UID:10016191-1773770400-1773788400@golocal.coop
SUMMARY:St. Paddy's Day with Pardon The Interruption LIVE! Featuring (extra) Special Guests Gas Money!
DESCRIPTION:This St. Patrick’s Day\, grab your best (green) dancin’ shoes and come on down to WonderStump!\nPardon the Interruption serves up ska-fueled funk\, rock\, reggae\, soul\, and upbeat jams– turning the night into a full-body celebration. High spirits\, happy feet\, and serious bounce guaranteed! \nGas Money will hit the stage to open up and get the blood pumpin’\, the funk-rock vibes groovin’\, and the energy sky high! \nWonderStump is an intentionally designed space for movement and flow. Enjoy the full-room energy without the crush of an overpacked venue! Creative attire encouraged\, immersive surprises in store\, light snacks and bevvies available for purchase. \nDoors at 6:30\, music at 7– with special guests opening ✨ \n$20 presale or hit us with $25 at the door 😎 \nall ages\nnonalcoholic drinks & craft mocktails available!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/st-paddys-day-with-pardon-the-interruption-live-featuring-extra-special-guests/
LOCATION:WonderStump!\, 301 Petaluma Blvd. N. Suite B\, Petaluma\, CA\, 94952\, United States
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Pardon-the-interruption-band-2s.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Sonoma.com": "https://www.sonoma.com/event/st-paddys-day-at-wonderstump/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:sonoma_com
X-SOURCE:Sonoma.com
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260317T180000
DTEND;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260317T230000
DTSTAMP:20260318T052419
CREATED:20260303T190110
LAST-MODIFIED:20260303T190326
UID:59396-1773770400-1773788400@https://www.sonoma.com
SUMMARY:St. Paddy’s Day at WonderStump
DESCRIPTION:St. Paddy’s Day with Pardon The Interruption at WonderStump invites guests to dance\, celebrate\, and wear their best green.    Pardon The Interruption brings a high-energy mix of ska-fueled funk\, rock\, reggae\, and soul\, turning the night into a full-body celebration with nonstop grooves and upbeat vibes. Surprise special guests will kick off the evening before the main performance.    This all-ages event offers non-alcoholic beverages and snacks available for purchase\, making it a fun and festive way to celebrate St. Patrick’s Day with friends and family.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/st-paddys-day-at-wonderstump/
LOCATION:301 Petaluma Boulevard North  Petaluma, CA 94952, Petaluma, CA, 94952, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Dancing,Holiday,Live Music,Music,Performing Arts,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/03/03190038/605680164_1447437194054949_7946532801895574464_n.jpg
END:VEVENT
