CREATED:20260219T202157
LAST-MODIFIED:20260219T202425
UID:59264-1773774000-1773774000@https://www.sonoma.com
SUMMARY:The Walker Roaders at Little Saint
DESCRIPTION:The Walker Roaders bring their high-energy Celtic-punk sound to Little Saint. The supergroup features James Fearnley of The Pogues\, Grammy-winning producer and former Flogging Molly member Ted Hutt\, and Marc Orrell of Dropkick Murphys. Formed in the U.S.\, the trio released their self-titled debut album in 2019\, blending traditional instruments like accordion\, mandolin\, and banjo with driving rock elements.    Rooted deeply in the Celtic-punk tradition\, their music spans rousing anthems and powerful ballads\, showcasing both grit and melody. With decades of combined experience across influential bands and productions\, The Walker Roaders deliver a dynamic live performance that honors the genre’s heritage while pushing it forward. Don’t miss this electrifying night of music at Little Saint.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/the-walker-roaders-at-little-saint/
LOCATION:25 North St, , Healdsburg, CA, 95448, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music,Music,Performing Arts,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/02/19202142/Screenshot-2026-02-19-222007.png
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.taradickinson.com/project-page/workshops", "Press Democrat": "https://www.taradickinson.com/project-page/workshops"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.taradickinson.com/project-page/workshops"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:March Month of Flowers Challenge
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260318T000000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260318T120000
UID:260306zcfdcHzdPUqIf9Ld_wSVgg
DESCRIPTION:Starting March 1st begins the "March Month of Flowers Challeng
 e" \\(online\\). \n\nYou'll receive a list of prompts for every day in Mar
 ch. \n\nCreate an art piece related to the prompt.\n\nShare in our privat
 e Facebook group.\n\nBe inspired and give inspiration to others.\n\nOnly $
 5\, so everyone can join and share in this creative adventure!\n\nMarch Mo
 nth of Flowers Challenge is here to give you a creative outlet\, some st
 ructure\, and respite from your brain. \n\nWhen you pick up a brush\, pen
 \, or pencil \\(thread\, clay\, fabric…\\)\, your brain gets a rest and 
 becomes more alive and flexible. The world around you becomes more alive\
 ; you pick up on shades\, details\, and patterns all around you. Your in
 tuition gets stronger. And fear lessens\, anxiety fades\, and curiosity gr
 ows. You stop worrying about making mistakes\, and instead\, you find the
  freedom to simply create
URL:https://www.taradickinson.com/project-page/workshops
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
