BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://creativesonoma.org/event/maija-peeples-bright-life-is-just-a-bowl-of-terriers/", "Creative Sonoma": "https://creativesonoma.org/event/maija-peeples-bright-life-is-just-a-bowl-of-terriers/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://creativesonoma.org/event/maija-peeples-bright-life-is-just-a-bowl-of-terriers/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Maija Peeples-Bright: Life is Just a Bowl of Terriers
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260318T110000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260318T170000
UID:260206DWGPVPoTlkGywPUkGAMa-w
DESCRIPTION:Maija Peeples-Bright is one of the few women artists associate
 d with Northern California's Funk Art movement of the late 1960s and '70s.
  Peeples-Bright's wildly inventive practice comprises robust compositions 
 bustling with animals of all kinds-her "beasties" as she calls them-formin
 g surreal\, imaginative landscapes in audacious impasto. Her zoological ar
 rangements represent alternate realities\, infusing exuberance and a sense
  of the absurd into impossible scenarios. Highly distinctive\, her textura
 l creature patterns revel in the extreme\, often taking up every inch of t
 he canvas\, multiplying her beasties into dizzying arrangements. Peeples-B
 right invites us into a decadence-gone-wild world all her own. The exhibit
 ion will feature a retrospective look at Peeples-Bright's career\, from he
 r early days of the Funk Movement to today.
LOCATION:Sonoma Valley Museum of Art
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/maija-peeples-bright-life-is-just-a-b
 owl-of-terriers/
X-SOURCE:Creative Sonoma, North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.exploretock.com/brandlinestate/experience/565565/the-brandlin-wine-food-tasting-experience?date=2026-03-12&size=2&time=10%3A00", "Press Democrat": "https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/the-brandlin-estate-wine-food-tasting-experience/18318441/2026-03-18T11"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.exploretock.com/brandlinestate/experience/565565/the-brandlin-wine-food-tasting-experience?date=2026-03-12&size=2&time=10%3A00"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:The Brandlin Estate Wine & Food Tasting Experience
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260318T110000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260318T160000
UID:260312B5_zC5FhN02EBNTkC-_HuA
DESCRIPTION:Born on the rugged slopes of Mount Veeder\, Brandlin Estate pr
 oduces wines of structure\, intensity\, and place. The Brandlin Experience
  offers an in-depth exploration of this historic vineyard site through a c
 urated tasting of five estate-grown wines—including Zinfandel from centu
 ry-old vines and the estate’s signature Cabernet Sauvignon. This seated\
 , guided experience invites guests to delve into the mountain terroir thro
 ugh the lens of small-lot winemaking. Each wine reflects the elevation\, e
 xposure\, and rocky soils that define the Brandlin Estate. For an added di
 mension\, guests may opt to include seasonal bites\, thoughtfully paired t
 o complement the structure and complexity of the wines. This experience is
  hosted at the picturesque Boathouse.
LOCATION:Brandlin Estate 
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/brandlinestate/experience/565565/the-brand
 lin-wine-food-tasting-experience?date=2026-03-12&size=2&time=10%3A00
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
