X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Arts Center
URL:https://santarosaartscenter.org/events/
SUMMARY:Artists In The RoundA time to share work & dialogue
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260318T135600
DTEND;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260318T193000
UID:7b4735112c6b4d6e7309ee3037e886a6@santarosaartscenter.org
DESCRIPTION:Meets the third Wednesday of the month.\nGet together with oth
 er creatives for  an evening of conversation and connection. Artists\, br
 ing a recent piece or one that  you are working on.\nPaintings\, 3-D work
 s\, writings\, dance\, all types of media are invited.\nEach artist has ti
 me to share your work\, your challenges and joys. Not a critique group\, b
 ut a time for empowerment.\nWhat we are trying to achieve:\nA collaboratio
 n of belonging\, inclusivity\, and artistic endeavor.\nA place of connecti
 on where artists feel welcomed to share their finished and unfinished art.
 \nAn invitation to trade ideas and recognize art potential.\nA place to sh
 are your unique and diverse ideas.\nCelebrating the quirky and playful art
  culture of Sonoma county.\nA creative adventure\, where all guests feel w
 elcomed and valued.\nBring your artwork\, your ideas and questions\, a san
 dwich\, a salad\, some soup\, or a snack\, and join us!\nFree\, but please
  consider a small donation\nRSVP: info@santarosaartscenter.org\n\nSource: 
 https://santarosaartscenter.org/events/
LOCATION:312 South A Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401
END:VEVENT
