SUMMARY:Leprechaun Treasure Hunt
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260319T080000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260319T180000
UID:260316HDNEbQ14VU68cdLivu2FiA
DESCRIPTION:Think you know our City parks well enough to be able to find t
 he elusive leprechauns?! Here’s how it works… --- DETAILS - Beginning 
 March 2\, visit any one of our City parks from the link below and hunt for
  leprechauns! - Leprechauns will be one-foot tall and laminated on card st
 ock. - If you find a leprechaun\, the directions on how and where to colle
 ct your prize will be on the back \\(also listed in the link below\\). The
  first day you can collect a prize is March 2. - Participants will only be
  allowed to win once\, and staff will be tracking each winner’s name. - 
 Staff will re-hide the leprechauns for others to find \\(last date of re-h
 iding is March 17\\). - March 30 will be the last day you can collect a pr
 ize for finding a leprechaun. --- MORE INFORMATION For more information\, 
 including a list of City parks where leprechauns will be hidden\, how to c
 ollect your prize\, and more\, please visit: SRCity.org/LeprechaunTreasure
 Hunt
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1963219561281656/1963334721270140/?act
 ive_tab=about
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.marincounty.gov/county-marin-calendar"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Marin Farmers Markets
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260319T080000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260319T130000
UID:250616nxYHGmgBmECNP4WRIW40-Q
DESCRIPTION:Price: Free\n\nSponsor: Marin Center\n\nExplore the bounty of 
 summer at the Marin Farmers Markets. Taste vine-ripened tomatoes\, corn th
 at was picked that morning\, and peaches so juicy you have to bend over ju
 st to get a bite. Farm-fresh eggs\, grass-fed beef\, artisan c heeses\, ra
 w milk\, and freshly baked breads complete the shopping exper ience. Speci
 alty prepared foods and handmade art add to the magic of the market.\n\nEn
 joy the intimate feeling of the Thursday Marin Farmers Market\, an ideal p
 lace to meet for lunch and pick up fresh produce for the weekend. Discover
  the abundance and diversity of product at the celebrated Sunday Marin Far
 mers Market\, the third largest farmers market in California. Turn your do
 llar into a vote for local sustainable agriculture\, shrink your eco-footp
 rint\, and revive the feeling of being intimate ly connected to your food 
 by meeting your farmers face-to-face. The market takes place rain or shine
 .\n\nwww.aginstitutemarin.org
