DESCRIPTION:An Afternoon of Understanding Anatomy With Miro. Spend a relax
 ed and inspiring afternoon exploring the fundamentals of anatomy drawing. 
 We'll explore simple ways to see the body through shapes\, proportions\, a
 nd movement - making anatomy easier to understand and draw. This is a welc
 oming\, low pressure space to sketch\, learn\, and share ideas with other 
 artists in the community. Whether you're just starting out or looking to r
 efresh your drawing skills\, all are welcome. Bring your sketchbooks\, pen
 cils\, and curiosity.\n\nPlease text 415-378-4732 to reserve a seat.
