BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Uptowntheatrenapa": "https://www.uptowntheatrenapa.com/event/the-fab-four-the-ultimate-tribute/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:uptowntheatrenapa
X-SOURCE:Uptowntheatrenapa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260319T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260319T200000
DTSTAMP:20260317T222428
CREATED:20250916T170034Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251210T213923Z
UID:25225-1773950400-1773950400@www.uptowntheatrenapa.com
SUMMARY:JaM Cellars Presents The Fab Four - The Ultimate Tribute
DESCRIPTION:March 19\, 2026\nPURCHASE TICKETS HERE  \nDoors 7pm/ Show 8pm\nAges: 12+ \nIf you want to experience the best Beatles tribute ever\, you won’t want to miss The Fab Four-The Ultimate Tribute. \nThe Emmy Award Winning Fab Four is elevated far above every other Beatles Tribute due to their precise attention to detail. With uncanny\, note-for-note live renditions of Beatles’ classics such as “Can’t Buy Me Love\,” “Yesterday\,” “A Day In The Life\,” “Twist And Shout\,” “Here Comes The Sun\,” and “Hey Jude”\, the Fab Four will make you think you are watching the real thing. \nTheir incredible stage performances include three costume changes representing every era of the Beatles ever-changing career\, and this loving tribute to the Beatles has amazed audiences in countries around the world\, including Japan\, Australia\, France\, Hong Kong\, The United Kingdom\, Germany\, Mexico and Brazil. \nThe Fab Four is truly the Ultimate tribute.
URL:https://www.uptowntheatrenapa.com/event/the-fab-four-the-ultimate-tribute/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.uptowntheatrenapa.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Fab-Four_1200x800.jpg
END:VEVENT
