X-SOURCE-URLS:{"GoLocal Cooperative": "https://golocal.coop/event/live-music-happy-hour-fridays-eric-t-bone-titus-downtown-santa-rosa/2026-03-20/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:golocal_coop
X-SOURCE:GoLocal Cooperative
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260320T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260320T180000
DTSTAMP:20260317T222419
CREATED:20251127T164841Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251127T164841Z
UID:10007615-1774018800-1774029600@golocal.coop
SUMMARY:Live Music Happy Hour Fridays - Eric "T-Bone" Titus - Downtown Santa Rosa
DESCRIPTION:Friday Happy Hour w/ Eric “T-Bone” Titus — live roots-rock & Americana @ Barrel Proof Lounge\, Downtown Santa Rosa. Our comedy show hits at 8\nEvery Friday\, roll into the weekend at Barrel Proof Lounge with Happy Hour sounds from Eric “T-Bone” Titus. This Santa Rosa singer-guitarist blends soulful Americana\, folk-rock\, and classic tunes that pair perfectly with a cold drink and an exhale after the workweek.\nSip $6 beers and enjoy $2 off wine and soju cocktails while T-Bone sets the tone for the night in Downtown Santa Rosa. Then stick around for our signature Friday stand-up comedy show at 8pm\, featuring rotating comics from across the Bay Area and beyond.\nMake Fridays at Barrel Proof Lounge your weekly ritual for live music\, laughs\, and laid-back vibes in Downtown Santa Rosa.\nCheck out www.BarrelProofLounge.com for all sorts of good times ahead!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/live-music-happy-hour-fridays-eric-t-bone-titus-downtown-santa-rosa/2026-03-20/
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge\, 501 Mendocino Avenue\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.44260;-122.71573
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Barrel Proof Lounge 501 Mendocino Avenue Santa Rosa CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=501 Mendocino Avenue:geo:-122.71573,38.44260
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup: Shut Up & Write Wine Country": "https://www.meetup.com/shutupandwritewinecountry/events/313578916/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_shutupandwrite
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Shut Up & Write Wine Country
UID:event_313578916@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260318T052421Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260320T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260320T163000
SUMMARY:Shut Up & Write!™ Santa Rosa REMOTE ZOOM FRIDAY 
DESCRIPTION:Shut Up & Write!® Wine Country\n**This event is hosted on the Shut Up & Write website\, so please [sign up here](https://shutupwrite.com/series/shut-up-write-online-with-lorraine-s/7480) for your writing event.**\n\n**ABOUT THE EVENT**\nWelcome! I will email passcode to those who register.\nBe sure to enable email on MeetUp!\nThen\, please check your email!\nJoin us virtually for an hour + of writing using Zoom. Let's keep together as much as we can during these uncertain times and keep on writing. Look for the schedule online and join us.\n\nWe’ve discovered that it’s strikingly helpful to write with other writers. See if it’s true for you at 3pm on Friday afternoon. Be it a book\, blog\, script\, essay\, dissertation\, resume\, melody\, poem or just plain work stuff\, you are invited to write it with us. No one will see what you've written or give you unsolicited advice. Instead of just thinking about writing\, come and get some real writing done.\n\nJOIN US!\n\n1. RSVP - space is limited to 12 people. (registration closes at one half hour before the event starts). You will receive the link to access the event at that time. REMEMBER TO CHECK YOUR EMAIL FOR PASSCODE!\n2. Before or at 3pm join the meeting with the link you receive AND ADD PASSCODE.\n\nPlease note:\n\n1. If you don't have Zoom set up on your computer yet\, leave 15-30 minutes ahead of time to get it set up!\n2. If you have difficulty with audio (don't have a microphone set up)\, as long as you have a speaker\, you can call in (you'll see phone numbers when you log in).\n3. If you are late\, you won't be able to intro with us\, but you are still welcome to join in.\n4. If you won't be able to make it\, please cancel so that the space is available to another writer.\n\nSCHEDULE:\n3:00 - quick intros.\naround 3:10 - timer starts: write for 70 mins.\n4:20 - (the end) wrap up\n\nWherever you are\, we hope to see you online! Keep on writing...\nRegards\,\nLorraine Segal
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/shutupandwritewinecountry/events/313578916/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260228T232535Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260228T232535Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/3/3/a/2/600_495253218.jpeg
END:VEVENT
