X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/womens-gathering-art-activism/18317182/2026-03-20T17", "Press Democrat": "https://www.taradickinson.com/lets-create/workshops"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/womens-gathering-art-activism/18317182/2026-03-20T17"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Womens Gathering: Art & Activism
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260320T170000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260320T190000
UID:260312jtkVlL-5XkuDqstf4WHUOw
DESCRIPTION:Women's Protest Art Gathering! Prepping for March 28th NO KIN
 GS National Protest!\n\nIf you've been feeling the need to do something\, 
 to express yourself\, please come! You can make posters\, signs\, paint ab
 stract\, release anger & energy\, do anything you feel needed. I'll have l
 ots of supplies\, examples of Protest Art.\n\n⭐️BONUS: The Sebastopol
  Center for the Arts has put out a call for artists: Resist and Persist: S
 ocial \\(in\\)Justice\n\nUse our Friday gathering to also Brainstorm & Pla
 n or Begin Your Art Entry for this show\n\n"Artists have always responded 
 at the forefront of cultural change. In times of unrest\, art does not sta
 y silent. It speaks truth\, demands change\, mourns loss\, and envisions h
 ope. We are seeking powerful\, original works that reflect the moment: art
  that confronts injustice\, reclaims identity\, honors resistance\, or env
 isions hope." All mediums are welcome\, including poetry! We want to hear
  your voice. Call Closes: May 1st\, 2026."
LOCATION:Full Circle Studio
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/womens-gathering-art-ac
 tivism/18317182/2026-03-20T17
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
