DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260321T160000
UID:260313SyvilNOfG0mnlxOrUY_jlQ
DESCRIPTION:We are hosting a Community Gardeners Exchange on March 21st\, 
 10am to 4pm! A day to bring and swap gardening supplies to start off the S
 pring Season. This event was inspired by a desire to repurpose materials w
 e have in abundance at Botaníca and provide an opportunity for other comm
 unity members to do the same. Examples of items to bring for the free exch
 ange are gloves\, seeds\, recent harvests\, plants\, hand tools\, etc. For
  more information check out our website or email us at info@botanicanurser
 yandgardens.com
