DESCRIPTION:Want to enjoy the fun of clay with your family?\n\n Join me i
 n my Fairfax studio for this fun class. Enjoy a creative morning of hand b
 uilding with your kids. Everybody will end up with a beautiful\, unique pi
 ece and a super fun shared experience! Everything is provided including as
  little or as much instruction as you want or need! Fees include clay\, to
 ols for your use\, glaze and firing. Wear clothes you don’t mind getting
  a little dirty! This class is for adults and children 8 and older. Adults
  can be accompanied by up to two children.\n\nCost: $65 per person.\n\nSki
 ll Level: All levels\, great for beginners\n\nDate: March 21st\, from 10:0
 0-11:30\n\nWhat to Expect After class I will glaze your work using the gla
 ze of your choice. It will be fired and ready for pick up within a few wee
 ks.\n\nPlease contact me if you have any questions: shoshanaparry@yahoo.co
 m or \\(415\\) 302-2559\n\nThere is a minimum of four people required to r
 un the class. If the number is not reached\, you will receive a full refun
 d.
LOCATION:My Studio
URL:https://shoshanaparry.com/classes-2/
