DESCRIPTION:Join Wiley’s Wish and Pawsarotti’s Dog & Cat Boutique for 
 a Spring Social: Adopt & Shop at Sonoma’s favorite pet shop!\n\nWHEN: Sa
 turday\, March 21 from 11 AM – 3 PM\n\nWHERE: 106 Calistoga Road\, Santa
  Rosa\, CA\n\nENTER TO WIN! Be sure to enter to win a Wiley's Wish Gift Ba
 sket worth over $500 and other items!\n\nCome meet incredible\, trained re
 scue dogs available for adoption\, soak up the spring vibes\, and maybe ev
 en meet your future best friend. While you’re here\, browse Pawsarotti
 ’s beautifully curated selection of toys\, treats\, food\, and pet suppl
 ies—thoughtfully chosen and stocked with care for pets of all kinds. We'
 ll have other special vendors in attendance to stay tuned - Follow @wileys
 wish or @pawsarottispetshop on Instagram for updates!\n\nWhether you’re 
 ready to adopt\, love meeting dogs\, or just want an excuse to shop for yo
 ur furry family member\, this is the perfect way to spend a spring Saturda
 y.\n\n🌼 Adopt 🦴 Shop 🐕 Fall in love! See you March 21!
LOCATION:Pawsarotti's Dog and Cat Boutique
