BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.scgsonline.org", "Press Democrat": "https://www.scgsonline.org"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.scgsonline.org"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Treasures in Our Stacks
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260321T123000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260321T143000
UID:260309KRPQgPDfxkqnOmGnvZb4aA
DESCRIPTION:The Sonoma County Genealogical Society Presents\n\n Treasures
  in Our Stacks: Boost Your Research with a Visit to the Napa Valley Geneal
 ogical Library With Sue Ziemski\, NVGS Librarian and Susan Ingersoll\, NVG
 S President\n\n The Napa Valley Genealogical Library has more than 9\,000
  holdings\, many of which are rare or unique. Whether you have Napa ancest
 ors or just live in Northern California\, the library probably has at leas
 t one resource you didn’t know you needed.\n\nThe library\, in its prese
 nt location since 1989\, is owned and operated by the Napa Valley Genealog
 ical Society. Please join us as we review the library’s holdings and hig
 hlight just a few of the many valuable Treasures in their stacks. You just
  might discover more than one way that this valuable Northern California r
 esource can advance your research.\n\n Susan Ingersoll and Sue Ziemski ar
 e the current President and Librarian\, respectively\, of Napa Valley Gene
 alogical Society. They have both been enthusiastic family history research
 ers for at least a couple of decades. Like their fellow NVGS members\, Sus
 an and Sue love the society’s unique library\, and enjoy spreading that 
 love to all who will listen.\n\n Saturday\, March 21st\n\n Meeting start
 s at 12:30 pm\, presentation starts at 1:00 pm PST\n\nFREE\n\nVia ZOOM\n\n
 Register at https://www.scgsonline.org\n\nRegistration closes Friday\, Mar
 ch 20th
URL:https://www.scgsonline.org 
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
