SUMMARY:Soul'd Out Band
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260321T130000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260321T160000
UID:260309NVBm--4jN0G-SsL2MRtrWA
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an afternoon of non-stop hits and timeless class
 ics with Soul'd Out Band! This talented band will take you on a musical jo
 urney through the decades with their eclectic mix of genres and styles. Fr
 om the soulful sounds of Stevie Wonder to the upbeat rhythm of Bruno Mars\
 , they've got something for everyone. Not only that\, but they also play a
 ll your favorite top 40 hits! Whether you're a fan of pop\, rock\, hip-hop
  or R&B\, Soul'd Out Band has got you covered.\n\nSo come join us and expe
 rience the musical magic of Soul'd Out! Whether you're looking for some fu
 n in the sun listening to great music\, or a romantic afternoon sipping on
  your favorite wine and dancing\, this band has got you covered. \n\nFood:
  Lasagna con Amore - Chef Massimo from Italy and wife Sonia\, will be serv
 ing sumptuous Lasagna Bolognese and tantalizing Lasagna Pesto\, along with
  Italian Meatballs in marinara sauce\, caprese salad\, and authentic Itali
 an desserts.\n\nMisc: Gate opens at noon.Minors welcome\, kids 12 and unde
 r are free. Well mannered and well managed puppy dogs are welcome in the o
 utside venue area. We will have seating for everyone.  Your own comfy fold
 ing chairs are welcome.\n\nNO outside alcohol of any kind!\n\nTICKETS ARE 
 $17 IF PURCHASED ONLINE\n\nTICKETS ARE $22 IF PURCHASED AT THE DOOR
LOCATION:Vino Godfather
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/soul-d-out-band/1829618
 1/2026-03-21T13
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
