SUMMARY:The Fargo Brothers
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260321T193000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260321T220000
UID:260303baqD2KQOHUuMuCR5g7K0hg
DESCRIPTION:Soaring harmonies\, rootsy grooves\, and high-energy tributes\
 , The Fargo Brothers deliver nonstop rock\, blues & Americana. The Fargo B
 rothers are an award-winning rock\, blues\, and Americana band celebrated 
 for their soaring vocal harmonies and tight\, electrifying ensemble playin
 g. Their high-energy shows feature crowd-pleasing medley tributes to legen
 ds like The Beatles\, Rolling Stones\, Tom Petty\, ZZ Top\, Stevie Ray Vau
 ghan\, John Hiatt\, and Delbert McClinton. Blending these classics seamles
 sly with a deep catalog of original songs\, The Fargo Brothers deliver a n
 onstop\, fun-filled performance that spans genres and generations\, bringi
 ng the stage to life from the first note to the last. BUY TICKETS IN ADVAN
 CE AND SAVE! ZONE A: $25 ZONE B: $20 ZONE C: $15 Tickets at the door: $25 
 \\(Zone C only\\) Showtime 7:30pm\, doors open 6:30pm Our kitchen is open 
 and serving our All New Menu from the time doors open until end of intermi
 ssion.
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1385718776163625/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.cloverdaleperformingarts.com/events/cloverdale-cabaret"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Cloverdale Cabaret
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260321T193000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260321T213000
UID:2603092J6mB-g4d0OQ06sjDATbNw
DESCRIPTION:The Cloverdale Cabaret was born at the Cloverdale Citrus Fair 
 as a bold\, scrappy passion project—our fledgling production stepping in
 to a new chapter\, and our first without longtime director Ashlyn at the h
 elm \\(missed dearly\\). \n\nWhat began as a spark of after-hours mischief
  has grown into an intimate cabaret-in-concert that showcases the heart of
  our company: some of the incredible singers and dancers you’ve loved in
  past productions\, reunited in a more up-close\, electric setting. \n\nTh
 is cabaret leans decidedly more adult than our Citrus Fair dinner show—c
 heekier\, sultrier\, and a little dangerous—while still celebrating the 
 theatricality\, live vocals\, and ensemble magic that define us. It’s a 
 chance to see familiar performers in a new light\, telling stories through
  big songs\, bold choreography\, and unapologetic flair\, all in the heart
  of our beloved town.
LOCATION:Cloverdale Performing Arts Center
URL:https://www.cloverdaleperformingarts.com/events/cloverdale-cabaret
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
