DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260322T150000
UID:260317vbRmTsHZjUiaoXCUIYNdWg
DESCRIPTION:Let your creativity **burn bright** and your style get a littl
 e… *higher*. Join us inside **The Lounge at Mercy** for a hands-on after
 noon of crafting\, chill vibes\, and good company. Bring a friend\, spark 
 your imagination\, and make something uniquely *you* — just be sure to g
 rab your ticket to save your spot!\n\nThis month’s **Craft & Chill** is 
 all about creating your very own **custom trucker “Junk Hat.”** We’l
 l have a variety of patches\, charms\, chains\, beads\, bedazzling supplie
 s\, and acrylic paint markers so you can design a hat that’s totally one
 -of-a-kind. Whether you go bold\, sparkly\, artsy\, or just a little *extr
 a*\, there’s no wrong way to make your masterpiece.\n\nSo roll up your s
 leeves\, add a little sparkle\, and let the creativity flow. By the end of
  the afternoon\, you’ll leave with a custom hat that’s **lit\, legit\,
  and totally you.**\n\nSpots are limited — snag your ticket and come **c
 raft\, chill\, and top off your look.**\n\nBrought to you by **PAX and Wee
 dLove.**\n\n**Date & Time**\n\n**Date:** Sunday\, March 22\, 2026\n\n**Tim
 e:** 12:00 - 3:00 PM\n\n**What’s Included**\n\nAll craft supplies\n\nGoo
 d vibes\n\nA cannabis-friendly lounge to spark your creativity\n\n**Ticket
  Tiers**\n\n**$20 - EARLY BIRD GA: Craft a Snapback Hat -** Includes the f
 ull Craft & Chill experience where you’ll design and bedazzle your own s
 napback hat. All supplies provided. Early bird pricing while supplies last
 . \n\n**$25 - General Admission: Craft a Snapback Hat -** Includes the Cra
 ft & Chill session where you’ll customize and bedazzle your own snapback
  hat. All materials and supplies included.\n\n**$30 - Craft a Snapback Hat
  + Sesh Starter (Joint) -** Craft your own bedazzled snapback hat and enjo
 y a 1g preroll to kick off your sesh while you create.\n\n**$35 - Craft a 
 Snapback Hat + Sesh Starter (Extract) -** Includes the snapback crafting e
 xperience plus one concentrate for guests who want a stronger lift while t
 hey craft and chill.\n\n**$35 - Craft a Snapback Hat + Sesh Starter (Flowe
 r) -** Craft your snapback hat and enjoy 1g of flower to elevate the creat
 ive session.\n\n**$35 - Craft a Snapback Hat + Sesh Starter (Vape) -** Inc
 ludes the snapback crafting session plus an all-in-one vape to enjoy durin
 g the event.\n\n**⭐ $50 - Craft a Snapback Hat + Flower Flight -** Inclu
 des the snapback crafting session plus a 3-gram flower tasting flight (thr
 ee 1g selections) to explore while you craft and chill.\n\n21+ Only | DCC 
 # C12-0000420-LIC
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://www.themercylounge.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
