SUMMARY:Non-Toxic Comedy Show™ - Featuring Scott Schafer - No Cover
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260322T180000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260322T200000
UID:260311DrJ0sQdofEWP5wE3QY8kQQ
DESCRIPTION:Tip-what-you-can comedy with headliner Scott Schafer\, plus ot
 her local faves including Hey Sienna. All the jokes with none of the traum
 a!\n\nWelcome to NON-TOXIC COMEDY SHOW™ from 6-8 pm at Redwood Cafe
  Cotati.\n\nThis Sunday\, your hosts Sienna The Comic and Jessika Frazer b
 ring you stand-up comedy from headliner Scott Schafer with Steve Wilkes\, 
 and Rory. Also featuring Hey Sienna\, advice from a Certified Life Advice 
 Mom - so bring your questions!\n\nThe show is No Cover\, so please Tip Wha
 t You Can to support local comedy : \\)\n\nAt Non-Toxic Comedy Show™ you
 ’ll get all the jokes with none of the trauma!\n\nNTCS™ guarantees our
  audience CLEAN\, NON-TOXIC comedy without having to worry about inappropr
 iate\, offensive\, cringeworthy content. Our CLEAN SHOW at Redwood Cafe\, 
 Cotati\, is safe for all ages\, genders\, and levels of sensitivity.\n\nDo
 n’t get us wrong – a great set always runs the risk of offending some
 one. Who could’ve known it really was too soon\, just for them?\n\nBu
 t there are some things we here at Non-Toxic Comedy Show™ think are alw
 ays too soon and will never age well. At NTCS you'll never hear anythin
 g hateful or malicious \, or jokes that punch down. Plus we keep things PG
  clean!\n\nRespectful innuendo is just funnier. The writing is hard\, the 
 material is smart\, the laughter is real. That's the toxic-free guarantee!
  We guarantee our audience Non-Toxic\, family-safe comedy.\n\nWhile we tru
 st our performers to adhere to these guidelines\, if a joke seems like it'
 s about to cross the line\, the performer will be cut off with a cowbell\,
  and may not be invited back. Our goal at Non-Toxic Comedy Show™? No Cow
 bell!
LOCATION:Redwood Cafe
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/non-toxic-comedy-showtm-featuring-scott-s
 chafer-no-cover-tickets-1984938783334?utm-campaign=social&utm-content=atte
 ndeeshare&utm-medium=discovery&utm-term=listing&utm-source=cp&aff=ebdsshco
 pyurl
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
