SUMMARY: Beginners Drawing Demonstration
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Elysia Rose Cordero\nDate: Sunday\, March 22nd\nT
 ime: 1:00PM-2:00PM\nLocation: Santa Rosa Store\nFree Demonstration!\n\n\n
 Introduction to Drawing Demonstration\n\nThis demonstration provides a fo
 undational introduction to the art of drawing\, designed for absolute beg
 inners. The session focuses on bridging the gap between seeing and recrea
 ting form on paper. Key areas of focus include:\n\n● Supply Essentials: A
  comprehensive look at the specific materials required for the course\, i
 ncluding the differences between pencil grades (H vs. B) and eraser types
 .\n\n● Proper Technique: Guidance on how to properly hold and use drawing
  supplies to achieve varying line weights and textures while maintaining 
 control.\n\n● The Artist’s Eye: Exercises dedicated to improving hand-eye
  coordination and observational skills\, teaching students to draw what t
 hey actually see rather than what they think they see.\n\nTeacher contact
 : Elysia.rose.cordero@gmail.com mailto:Elysia.rose.cordero@gmail.com\n\n
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Free-Demo,Art-Demo,Drawing
