SUMMARY: Watercolor Fundamentals Part 2
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Anne Millett\n\nThis is a 6-class series\, meetin
 g 6 Tuesdays March 24\, 31\, April 7\, 14\, 21\, 28\n10:30-1:00PM\nLocati
 on: Santa Rosa Store\n$270.00\n\nThere will be a materials fee of $15 plu
 s tax for the series.\n\n*optional 7th and 8th classes priced separately\
 , May 5 and 12\n\n\nWatercolor Fundamentals - Part 2\n\nThis next series 
 will build on what we learned in Part 1\, quickly refreshing some techniq
 ues and then applying them in our paintings. We will create more complex 
 landscape paintings\, skies and seascapes\; wet-into-wet and wet-into-dry
  nature studies in a few different ways\, and we will venture further int
 o painting from our imaginations. We will explore abstraction and non-rep
 resentational styles\, where we don't look at something and try to paint 
 it\, but instead work intuitively with colors and shapes and let the pain
 tings emerge and evolve from there. You don't have to know where you're g
 oing\, enjoy the journey and see where it takes you!\n\nThis class is des
 igned for adults 18+\n\nClass sizes are limited to 8 people\, please regi
 ster early\n\n$270 for 6 classes\, 2.5 hours each class\n\nThere will be 
 a materials fee of $15 plus tax for the series.\n\n*optional 7th and 8th 
 classes priced separately\nPayable via check\, cash\, or Zelle.\n\n*Brush
 es\, palettes\, set-ups\, and paint will be provided.*\n\n\nTo see Anne's
  work and to learn more about this class\, please visit her website at: w
 ww.miraaster.com http://www.miraaster.com/\n\n\nTo register for this work
 shop\, please contact Anne by email at: mailto:amillett@gmail.com classes
 @miraaster.com mailto:classes@miraaster.com
