 meeting 6 Tuesdays March 24\, 31\, April 7\, 14\, 21\, 28 2:00-4:30PM Loc
 ation: Santa Rosa Store $270.00...
LOCATION:Rileystreet Art Supply\,103 Maxwell Ct\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401\,
  USA
