DTSTAMP:20260318T052421Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260325T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260325T143000
SUMMARY:Shut Up & Write!® Sebastopol: In Person
DESCRIPTION:Shut Up & Write!® Wine Country\nJoin us for an hour of writing! Any kind of writing\, including a novel\, blog\, script\, dissertation\, melody\, poem\, memoir\, etc. No one will see what you've written or give unsolicited advice. Try it out at 1:00 PM on Wednesday afternoons.\n\nSCHEDULE:\n\n1:00-1:15: Introductions\n\n1:15-2:15: Write in silence for 1 hour\n\n2:15-2:30: Check-ins: how did it go?\n\nDetails:\n\n\\- Wifi: Coffee & Moore has wifi\\. Password: goodcoffee\n\n\\- Parking: This location has a parking lot\\.\n\n\\- Patronage: Please thank our hosts by purchasing something\\.\n\n\\- Outlets: Scattered around if you need to charge your laptop\\.\n\n\\- Noise: Some writers use headphones or earplugs to block ambient noise\\.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/shutupandwritewinecountry/events/313656267/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260305T221840Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260305T221840Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/c/b/f/600_505180127.jpeg
END:VEVENT
