SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260318T052425Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260325T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260325T143000
SUMMARY:Disarmed by Wisdom
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\n**Disarmed by Wisdom**\n\nIn making breakthroughs in living\, getting unstuck\, releasing anxiety\, letting go of who we are not\, we need to unlearn and learn anew. Our full growing up and maturation involves the expansive movement from belief to knowledge to wisdom. As we become more receptive to the Master Within\, it will increasingly assist us in this process. If the outer self is overprotective\, overbearing\, oblivious\, or resistant to lessons\, wisdom will disarm it and transform us. Join Hugh McCague as we continue to explore Rosicrucian laws and principles and their creative expression and application for the mastery of life\, harmonious living\, and service.\n\n**Please RSVP to access log-in link. Click Attend Online button below.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/313743827/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260311T150309Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260311T150309Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/1/c/1/600_533149601.jpeg
END:VEVENT
