X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_shutupandwrite
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Shut Up & Write Wine Country
UID:event_313598396@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260318T052421Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260326T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260326T120000
SUMMARY:Shut Up & Write!® at Redwood Café in Cotati (in person)
DESCRIPTION:Shut Up & Write!® Wine Country\n**Coworking for writers in Cotati!**\nJoin us for some focused writing time. All experience levels are welcome\, and don’t worry\, no one will see what you've written. This session is about WRITING\, whether you're working on a novel\, memoir\, play\, short story\, dissertation\, job application\, blog\, poetry\, journal\, or song.\n\n**Format**\n10:00 - 10:15 AM: Introduce yourself and what you're working on today\n10:15 - 11:30 AM: Write in silence for 1 hour and 15 minutes.\n11:30 - 11:45 AM: Check in with one another and share how it went\n\n**Venue Details:**\n\n* Redwood Cafe has WiFi for guests\n* Ample street parking is available\n* Please thank our hosts by purchasing something\n* If music or ambient noise are distracting\, please bring ear plugs or headphones\n* Outlets are available if you need to charge your laptop
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/shutupandwritewinecountry/events/313598396/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260302T071957Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260302T071957Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/1/2/1/600_518660769.jpeg
END:VEVENT
