BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.thesearanchlodge.com/programming/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Breath Awareness at The Sea Ranch Lodge
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260327T150000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260327T154500
UID:260313MnwONtDlYEGGa9DRBlmfwA
DESCRIPTION:Join certified breathwork instructor Jill Nussinow for a 45-mi
 nute Breath Awareness session designed to help you reconnect with your ner
 vous system through conscious breathing. This guided experience focuses on
  accessing the parasympathetic “rest and digest” response\, offering p
 ractical tools to support relaxation\, resilience\, and overall well-being
 .\n\nParticipants will learn a variety of simple yet effective breathing t
 echniques that can be incorporated into daily life to promote calm\, reduc
 e stress\, and support deeper\, more restorative sleep.\n\nJill brings ove
 r five years of experience as a certified breathwork instructor\, teaching
  both locally and internationally\, in person and via Zoom. Learn more at 
 **breathwisehealth.com**. $40 per person. 12 guests maximum.
LOCATION:The Sea Ranch Lodge 
URL:https://www.thesearanchlodge.com/programming/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
