DESCRIPTION:Osito formed in the summer of 2015 in Santa Rosa\, CA during a
  production of the hit musical "Buddy" the Buddy Holly story. The group im
 mediately had too much fun playing music across California and Texas\, and
  over the next decade couldn't quit finding new incarnations of the same s
 ongwriter-driven\, rock-n-roll roots that connected them in the first plac
 e. Today\, their balance of in-the-pocket guitar-forward compositions and 
 deep-cut\, horn-centric grooves continues to offer a versatility of instru
 mentation unique to the Bay Area scene.
