DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260328T120000
UID:260225z_a7ztkZgkyYb4Elm4a63w
DESCRIPTION:Join us for on the farm on Saturday\, March 28\, 2026\, for a
  Day of Service honoring farm worker rights activists César Chávez and D
 olores Huerta.\n\nWe’ll have volunteer activities from 9 a.m. to noon.\n
 \nSign up for a spot at Calendly.com/PetalumaBounty\n\nKids are welcome w
 ith an accompanying adult.\n\nAs César Chávez Day\, March 31\, approache
 s\, we reflect on the legacy of Chávez and Huerta\, who bravely fought t
 he injustices and exploitative labor practices of California’s biggest a
 gribusinesses. We reflect on all farmworkers’ ongoing and often unsung c
 ontributions to society.
LOCATION:Petaluma Bounty Community Farm
URL:https://www.petalumabounty.org/join-us-our-2026-cesar-chavez-dolores-h
 uerta-day-of-service-scheduled-for-march-28/
