DESCRIPTION:Join the City of Cotati for the second annual Climate Ready Co
 tati Fair on March 28\, 2026 from 10-2 at the Cotati SMART Depot \\(970 E 
 Cotati Avenue\, Cotati\, CA 94931\\). The Fair is FREE and will feature 
 40 local agencies and organizations sharing resources\, information\, and 
 ideas to help you live a more sustainable lifestyle and have a positive im
 pact on the environment. Cotati's own Sal's Pizza and Dogs A La Carte will
  offer great food for sale\, featuring reusable dishes provided by Sparkl 
 Reusables to reduce disposables waste. Prize giveaways\, kids’ activitie
 s\, an e-waste dropoff\, small appliance repair\, and much more will be av
 ailable at this awesome event. Join us for activities to help you reduce\,
  reuse\, and recycle... and have fun!\n\nVisit the Climate Ready Cotati Fa
 ir webpage for more information: https://bit.ly/CRCFair2026
