BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/resilience-working-with-trauma-cultivating-aliveness-pb1m26/?lang=en", "Press Democrat": "https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/online-resilience-working-with-trauma-cultivating-aliveness/18115218/2026-03-28T10"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/resilience-working-with-trauma-cultivating-aliveness-pb1m26/?lang=en"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Online: Resilience--Working with Trauma\, Cultivating Aliveness
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260328T100000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260328T160000
UID:260214blgS2gXaJUquBAtntjcHjw
DESCRIPTION:with Pawan Bareja\, PhD and Peter Levine\n\nIn a time when dai
 ly stress\, social upheaval\, and the climate crisis leave many of us over
 whelmed or “stuck” in fight\, flight\, or freeze\, our natural resilie
 nce can feel out of reach. This weekend retreat offers a grounded path bac
 k to your inherent aliveness and inner strength.\n\nTogether\, we’ll exp
 lore practices that support the body and mind in returning toward balance 
 during moments of fear\, helplessness\, and emotional overload. Drawing fr
 om time-tested mindfulness practices and evidence-informed stress-reductio
 n and resilience tools backed by neuroscience\, participants will explore 
 ways to settle the body and meet challenges with clarity and compassion.\n
 \nOur time will include teachings\, guided stationary and movement meditat
 ions\, trauma teachings\, self-reflection\, and Q&A. This weekend will inc
 lude discussion and demonstration sessions led by Peter Levine\, PhD\, whi
 ch are not CE-eligible. Many practitioners experience a more joyful heart\
 , deeper sleep\, improved digestion\, steadier relationships\, and a renew
 ed sense of belonging.\n\nThis retreat is an opportunity to return to your
 self—to reclaim ease\, courage\, and the essence of aliveness.
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/resilience-working-wit
 h-trauma-cultivating-aliveness-pb1m26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
