DESCRIPTION:Meet and Support Local Authors\n\nThis event will be held in p
 erson in Room 5 of the Senior Wing at the Finley Center.\n\nFREE for Membe
 rs\, Guests & General Public\n\nJoin the Redwood Writers Branch for a spec
 ial Author Launch celebrating 18 local authors and their newly published 
 books. This lively community event brings readers and writers together for
  an inspiring morning of short readings\, book sales\, and conversation.\n
 \nAttendees will have the opportunity to meet local authors\, hear them sh
 are from their work\, and connect with fellow writers and readers in our v
 ibrant literary community. Whether you’re a longtime supporter of local 
 writing or simply curious to discover new voices\, Author Launch offers a 
 welcoming space to celebrate creativity and connection.\n\nThe event will 
 be recorded for later viewing and sharing. Details on featured authors can
  be found on our website\, https://redwoodwriters.org/author-launch/
LOCATION:Finley Center
URL:https://redwoodwriters.org/author-launch/
