UID:250917BVex7ZiEq0GjmbDbVmUzJQ
DESCRIPTION:Begin your wine-tasting experience with a guided tasting led b
 y our host\, who will introduce you to our exclusive estate Russian River 
 Valley wines. Once you have found your favorite\, choose a glass from our 
 specialty curated wine flight to enjoy with a delicious picnic lunch\, pre
 pared by our local partners at Willow Wood Market & Cafe. Reservations req
 uired with advanced booking of 48 hours.\n\n$85 per guest | Club Member: $
 45 per guest
LOCATION:Dutton Estate Winery
URL:https://www.duttonestate.com/visit-us/tasting-reservations/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
