DESCRIPTION:Key Lime Pie brings their "Rock & Roll\, Latin Soul" and puts 
 on a show that will have you tapping your feet and bobbing your head to th
 e beats. And before you know it\, you'll be shaking a leg on the dance flo
 or with friends \\(and maybe even some strangers\\). Their music covers a 
 wide spectrum and they never fail to impress. Classic Rock \\(such as the 
 Stones\, Doobie Bros.\, Steely Dan\, Dead\, Allmans\\) Latin Rock \\(such 
 Santana\\) R&B \\(such as Stevie Wonder\, Chaka Khan\, B.B. King\, The Tem
 ptations\\) New Orleans Funk \\(such as the Neville Bros.\, Dr. John\\) Fo
 od: TBD Misc: Gate opens at noon. Minors welcome\, kids 12 and under are f
 ree. Well mannered and well managed puppy dogs are welcome in the outside 
 venue area. We will have seating for everyone. Your own comfy folding chai
 rs are welcome. \\*You may bring your own water and "light snacks." NO lar
 ge catering trays\, chafing dishes\, tables\, or other large party supplie
 s allowed. Must coordinate celebrations with venue. info@vinogodfather.com
 . NO outside alcohol of any kind! Tickets: $17 in advance\, $22 at the doo
 r Get tickets
LOCATION:Vino Godfather Winery
URL:https://www.visitvallejo.com/events/upcoming-events/key-lime-pie-class
 ic-rock-with-a-latin-vibe
