DESCRIPTION:Join our various workshops on running TTRPG's such as fundamen
 tal basics\, do's and don'ts\, running and/or creating adventures\, campa 
 igns\, settings\, support from fellow GMs and more! \n\nEvery second and f
 ourth Saturday of the month. https://www.lakecountyca.gov/calendar.aspx?EI
 D=6212
