SUMMARY:Meet the Vallejo Sun Team
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260328T170000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260328T200000
UID:260311K__xapzEUEOKna1ZMj1XoQ
DESCRIPTION:Come grab a beer with the reporters and editors\, learn about 
 what we do\, and support local journalism.\n\nOur editors and reporters wi
 ll be at the Mare Island Brewing Co. Coal Shed Brewery on March 28 to meet
  subscribers and members of the community and chat about the work we do co
 vering local government\, policing\, schools\, and Vallejo’s arts and cu
 lture scene. It’s a great chance to put faces to bylines\, ask questions
 \, and connect with others who care about strong local journalism.\n\nWe
 ’ll also have Vallejo Sun stickers\, pens\, and sunglasses available for
  purchase.\n\nAre you a paid subscriber who wants to go the extra mile? If
  you're comfortable speaking on camera\, we’ll have opportunities to rec
 ord short videos with one of our journalists about why supporting local jo
 urnalism matters to you. With your permission\, these clips will be edited
  and shared on our social channels during our upcoming spring subscription
  drive.\n\nWhether you’re a longtime subscriber or just curious about wh
 at we do\, we’d love to see you there.
LOCATION:Coal Shed Brewery
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/meet-the-vallejo-sun-team-tickets-1984644
 904334
