DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260328T210000
UID:260304muPtnRDY1kGXxZCc5p3O9A
DESCRIPTION:Trivia Night at the Vallejo Museum! \n\nCome join us for a fun
 -filled evening of brain teasers and friendly competition at the Vallejo 
 Naval and Historical Museum! Test your knowledge on a variety of topics wh
 ile enjoying snacks and drinks with friends. Whether you’re a trivia mas
 ter or just looking for a good time\, this event is perfect for all. Don
 ’t miss out on a chance to win awesome prizes and bragging rights! See y
 ou there! \n\nTickets are $40 per person OR $320 for a table \\(a team of 
 8\\) \n\nBuy tickets at the Vallejo Museum Gift Shop or online.
LOCATION:Vallejo Naval and Historical Museum
URL:https://vallejomuseum.net/event/vallejo-museum-trivia-night-2024/
