DESCRIPTION:Repertoire subject to change \n\n\n\nTicket Information\n\n\n\nPre-concert $15/adult\, $5/youth                  \n\n\n\nAt the Door$20/adult\, $10/youth \n\n\n\nPlease note: the pre-concert price is valid until 11 AM of the Friday preceding the concert. After that\, tickets can only be purchased at the door. \n\n\n\nTickets for this concert are sold through the Phoenix Theater.  \n\n\n\nTicket fees apply for all online orders. We suggest buying your ticket in advance on line. For door ticket\, sales we suggest paying with cash. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWe gratefully acknowledge the generous contributions from the following:\n\n\n\nYoung People’s Chamber Orchestra is sponsored by Garth Bixler \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nPrograms\, dates\, artists\, and prices are subject to change without notice. Tickets are nonrefundable and subject to availability.\n\n\n\nPhoto by Susan & Neil Silverman Photography
