UID:260223odEC_4_TlkqC932kUmVY_g
DESCRIPTION:Papa Joe & The New Deal\, your family band. When you come see 
 their show you are instantly a member of the family. They will entertain y
 ou with feel good music that you are sure to recognize and love. They will
  give you a show that might touch 60 to 80 songs because of their ability 
 to move in and out of songs with the greatest of ease. They will move you 
 with soul\, R&B\, reggae\, old school funk and Latin rock. They will take 
 you from the sixties to today with an effortless passion that might just t
 ouch your soul. "Come join the family\, we are waiting for you!" Food: TBD
  Misc: Gate opens at noon. Minors welcome\, kids 12 and under are free. We
 ll mannered and well managed puppy dogs are welcome in the outside venue a
 rea. We will have seating for everyone. Your own comfy folding chairs are 
 welcome. \\*You may bring your own water and "light snacks." \\*\\*NO larg
 e catering trays\, chafing dishes\, tables\, or other large party supplies
  allowed. Must coordinate celebrations with venue. info@vinogodfather.com 
 NO outside alcohol of any kind! Tickets: $17 in advance\, $22 at the door 
 Get tickets
LOCATION:Vino Godfather Winery
URL:https://www.visitvallejo.com/events/upcoming-events/papa-joe-the-new-d
 eal-ultimate-family-dance-party-2
