SUMMARY:Group Chanting and Crystal Singing Bowls
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260329T160000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260329T180000
UID:260311hQVTCfORKUKW0QCygXJlmg
DESCRIPTION:Join us in praying for World Peace in 2026 using the meditativ
 e OM.\n\nNow is an important time to utilize the frequency of the Energy W
 ave Center plus our focused intentions\, for Peace in our communities\, ou
 rselves and our world. It’s a valuable window to help change course for 
 the better. More prayer now to strengthen possibilities for peace! This ev
 ent is a powerful Peace prayer and crystal bowl sound healing\, we hope yo
 u can join us!”\n\nThings have changed since we first started OM Peace p
 rayers\, with Peace between India and Pakistan plus 5 other conflicts. We
 ’d like to see an end to the Ukraine-Russia conflict\, and continued Pea
 ce in the middle east. It’s all happening in this very moment.\n\nIn the
  2nd hour we direct the potent field created in the first through suggeste
 d visioning\, sharing dialog and a sound bath to help us all integrate. Co
 me join OM for Peace and lets Be The Change We Want to See in the World!\n
 \nAbout Your Guides\n\nEmile Canning is a Mediator & former owner of The 
 Integratron. He is a pioneer in frequency healing and personal growth. Pro
 ducer of Peacewave Productions\, creator of uplifting & peaceful events th
 roughout California.\n\nAnanda Fierro is an Advanced Bodyworker & Sound-E
 nergy Healer\, utilizing unique frequency medical devices to accelerate po
 sitive outcomes\, for over 2 decades. She studied with Jill Purce\, Sound 
 & Ancestral Healing pioneer in the UK.
LOCATION:Energy Wave Center
URL:https://energywavecenter.com/om-for-peace/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.northbayoa.org/", "Press Democrat": "https://www.northbayoa.org/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.northbayoa.org/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Overeaters Anonymous (OA) Newcomer Meeting in Santa Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260329T160000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260329T170000
UID:26021276DO4pIzNEWU2upEavJSKQ
DESCRIPTION:**Is Food a Problem for You? You Are Not Alone.**\n\nOvereater
 s Anonymous (OA) is a fellowship of people who support each other in recov
 ering from compulsive eating and food behaviors. If you feel you have a pr
 oblem with food\, OA welcomes you—no matter what your background\, belie
 fs\, or eating habits.\n\nWe hold an in-person newcomer meeting on **Sunda
 ys from 4:00 – 5:00 PM** **at Christ Church United Methodist\, 1717 Yulu
 pa Ave.\, Room #4\, Santa Rosa**. Contact: Abigail (707) 293-5888. You may
  view all North Bay OA in-person and online meetings at https://www.northb
 ayoa.org/meetings.html .\n\nIn OA\, members experience **spiritual\, emoti
 onal\, and physical recovery** by practicing the **Twelve Steps** and livi
 ng by their spiritual principles—one day at a time.\n\nOA is **not** a d
 iet club or calorie-counting program.\n\nMembers have different plans of e
 ating.\n\nOA does **not** endorse any specific food plan.\n\nIf food is ca
 using problems in your life\, you don’t have to struggle alone. Recovery
  is possible\, and help is available.\n\n**Visit:** https://www.northbayoa
 .org/\n\n**Find a meeting:** https://www.northbayoa.org/meetings.html
LOCATION:Christ Church United Methodist
URL:https://www.northbayoa.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.thesearanchlodge.com/programming/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Sound Healing with Deborah Johnsen
