SUMMARY:Study Abroad in Costa Rica – Summer 2026 - Final Information Se
 ssion
DESCRIPTION:SRJC students have the opportunity to spend July 5–26\, 202
 6 studying yoga and wellness in beautiful Costa Rica while earning 6 unit
 s of college credit.  The program includes yoga training\, cultural exper
 iences\, and exciting excursions such as visits to Manuel Antonio Nationa
 l Park\, Monteverde Cloud Forest\, and Indigenous communities.  Meeting i
 nformation:Monday\, March 30th at 12pmhttps://santarosa-edu.zoom.us/j/894
 54075619?from=addon  For more information\, visit SRJC's Study Abroad web
 site! (https://study-abroad.santarosa.edu/costa-rica-summer-2026-informat
 ion)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  SRJC students have the opportunity to s
 pend July 5–26\, 2026 studying yoga and wellness in beautiful Costa Ric
 a while earning 6 units of college credit.</p><p>  The program includes y
