BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.northbayoa.org/", "Press Democrat": "https://www.northbayoa.org/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.northbayoa.org/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Overeaters Anonymous (OA) Newcomer Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260404T094500
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260404T101500
UID:260212xjJbjYHpDEOwEQiEtBeqJQ
DESCRIPTION:**Is Food a Problem for You? You Are Not Alone.**\n\nOvereater
 s Anonymous (OA) is a fellowship of people who support each other in recov
 ering from compulsive eating and food behaviors. If you feel you have a pr
 oblem with food\, OA welcomes you—no matter what your background\, belie
 fs\, or eating habits. \n\nWe hold an in-person newcomer meeting on first
 \, second and fourth **Saturdays of the month from 9:45 - 10:15 AM at** 
 ​**Unitarian Universalist Congregation of Marin\, 240 Channing Way\, San
  Rafael CA 94903**. Contact: Sue M. 415-298-6792​. You may view all Nor
 th Bay OA in-person and online meetings at https://www.northbayoa.org/meet
 ings.html\n\nIn OA\, members experience **spiritual\, emotional\, and phys
 ical recovery** by practicing the **Twelve Steps** and living by their spi
 ritual principles—one day at a time.\n\nOA is **not** a diet club or cal
 orie-counting program.\n\nMembers have different plans of eating.\n\nOA do
 es **not** endorse any specific food plan. \n\nIf food is causing problem
 s in your life\, you don’t have to struggle alone. Recovery is possible\
 , and help is available.\n\n**Visit:** https://www.northbayoa.org/\n\n**Fi
 nd a meeting:** https://www.northbayoa.org/meetings.html
LOCATION:Unitarian Universalist Congregation of Marin
URL:https://www.northbayoa.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.goatlandia.org/bottle-babies-breakfast-club", "Press Democrat": "https://www.goatlandia.org/bottle-babies-breakfast-club"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.goatlandia.org/bottle-babies-breakfast-club"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Bottle Baby Breakfast Club
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260404T100000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260404T160000
UID:260312HYpGsZYuqEaFXtGYRen2zQ
DESCRIPTION:**Tiny Hooves\, Big Hearts: Our Ongoing Rescue Mission**\n\n**
 At Goatlandia\, our mission is simple: to give love\, safety\, and a secon
 d chance to animals who need it most.**\n\n**We were recently called to re
 scue three baby goats. These tiny babies are now safe at Goatlandia\, and 
 they need bottle feeding several times a day to stay healthy and thrive.**
 \n\n**That’s Where You Come In: The Bottle Baby Breakfast Club**\n\n**St
 arting March 6th\, join us for a heartwarming hour on the farm\, bottle-fe
 eding and cuddling our newest rescues while supporting their care.**\n\n**
 Your $250 donation (covers milk and supplies for weeks of feedings) includ
 es admission for up to four guests for a private\, unforgettable visit to 
 Goatlandia.**\n\n**Come share the love\, feel the magic\, and help us give
  these little ones the future they deserve.**
LOCATION:Goatlandia
URL:https://www.goatlandia.org/bottle-babies-breakfast-club
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
