BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://salsadancemarin.com/bachata-beginners/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Bachata Beginners Saturday
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260404T110000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260404T120000
UID:260317JLsDIQhrTUio7WOVLF8QeQ
DESCRIPTION:This class is perfect for bachata beginners that want to learn
  basic steps and skills\, or those who want to refresh their foundational 
 skills. We understand that learning something new can feel a little intimi
 dating. That’s why our supportive and relaxed environment is specificall
 y designed to make learning bachata basics an absolute blast!\n\nOur frien
 dly instructors will guide you through:\n\nBasic directional steps: You
 ’ll learn the fundamental movements that form the building blocks of all
  bachata dancing.\n\nProper frame for partner work: Discover how to conne
 ct comfortably and effectively with a partner\, setting you up for smooth 
 and enjoyable dances.\n\nSimple turn patterns: We’ll introduce you to e
 asy-to-follow turn patterns that will have you dancing with a partner in n
 o time.\n\nWe’ve carefully organized our curriculum to ensure that each 
 movement is easy to grasp and remember\, building your confidence with eve
 ry step. Our goal is to make learning fun. Join us to learn Bachata in Mar
 in.\n\nImportant Details\n\nNo dance experience required: Whether you’v
 e never danced before or it’s been a while\, you’re welcome here!\n\nN
 o partner necessary: Come solo or bring a friend—either way\, you’ll 
 have plenty of opportunities to dance.\n\nPlease wear non-marking shoe so
 les: This helps us keep our dance floor in great condition.\n\nCome join 
 us and discover the joy of bachata! We can’t wait to see you on the danc
 e floor.\n\nDate & Time:\n\nThursdays @ 6:30PM – 7:30PM Fridays @ 5:30PM
  – 6:30PM Saturdays @ 9:00 AM – 10:00 AM\n\nInstructor: Lucie Ebnerova
 \n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8 San Rafael\, CA\n\nNote: Arrive 10 
 minutes before. No floor marking shoe soles allowed.
LOCATION:4140 Redwood Highway #8 San Rafael
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/bachata-beginners/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://healdsburgcenterforthearts.org/small-wonders-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Small Wonders
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260404T110000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260404T170000
UID:2603171UKAU5XKgki3TSGtsH7mkg
DESCRIPTION:Call for Art: Small Wonders\n\nSome of the most exquisite beau
 ty can be captured in the smallest of images and objects: the iridescence 
 of a hummingbird in flight\, a millefiori paperweight\, Faberge eggs\, or 
 a miniature woven basket. These pieces are modest in size but powerful in 
 creativity and expression.\n\nHealdsburg Center for the Arts (HCA) invites
  artists to submit paintings\, original fine art prints\, collage\, mixed 
 media\, drawings\, fiber arts\, sculptures\, ceramics\, and jewelry for th
 is exhibition.\n\nApplication Requirements:\n\n\\- Platform: All applicati
 ons must be submitted via EntryThingy\n\n\\- Eligibility: Work must be ori
 ginal and completed within the past two years. Photos in the application m
 ust represent the actual work intended for exhibition.\n\n\\- Size/Weight:
  Artwork must not exceed 12" x 12" unframed (144 sq in) or 196 sq in frame
 d. Maximum weight is 40 lbs.\n\n\\- Display: 2-D pieces must be securely w
 ired (no alligator clips). 3-D work must be stable\; artists are responsib
 le for on-site assembly if required.\n\n\\- Sales: All work must be for sa
 le. HCA retains a 40% commission\; artists receive 60%. Please list retail
  prices only.\n\nKey Dates:\n\n\\- Entry Deadline: May 10\, 2026 (9 PM)\n\
 n\\- Notification of Selection: By May 13\, 2026\n\n\\- Shipped Work Deadl
 ine: Wednesday\, May 27\, 2026 (must include pre-paid return label)\n\n\\-
  Hand-Delivery: Sunday\, May 31 (12–4 PM) and Monday\, June 1 (11 AM–1
  PM)\n\n\\- Exhibition Dates: June 4\, 2026 – July 19\, 2026\n\n\\- Open
 ing Reception: Saturday\, June 6\, 2026 (4–6 PM)\n\n\\- Pick-up/Return S
 hipping: July 19 (12–4 PM) and July 20 (11 AM–1 PM)\; shipping the wee
 k of July 20.\n\nEntry Fees:\n\n\\- Non-Members: $50 (1 entry)\, $55 (2 en
 tries)\, $60 (3 entries). Includes a $60 yearly supporter membership.\n\n\
 \- Current Members: $40 (1 entry)\, $45 (2 entries)\, $50 (3 entries).
LOCATION:Healdsburg Center for the Arts
URL:https://healdsburgcenterforthearts.org/small-wonders-2/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
