DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Easter with a springtime gathering designed for all 
 ages\, set against the scenic beauty of Napa Valley. Join us in the elegan
 t Meritage Ballroom for an indulgent Easter brunch buffet\, thoughtfully p
 repared and paired with live music by the Ariel Marin Band\, creating a wa
 rm and festive tone for the day. Families are invited to linger and explor
 e a full lineup of seasonal activities throughout the afternoon at the Car
 neros Ballroom and Activities Lawn. Children will delight in hourly Easter
  egg hunts\, Easter Bunny photos\, a petting zoo\, face painting\, and a p
 hoto booth. With joyful moments unfolding at every turn\, Easter at The Me
 ritage is a cherished tradition designed to create unforgettable memories.
  Easter Egg Hunt Schedule: Ages 4-13: 11:00am\, 12:00pm\, 1:00pm\, 2:00pm\
 , 3:00pm Ages 3 & under: 10:30am\, 11:30am\, 12:30pm\, 1:30pm\, 3:30pm Pri
 cing: $135 for ages 14\\+\, $50 for ages 4-13\, Free for ages 3 & under Mi
 nors under the age of 18 must be accompanied by a responsible adult during
  the hours of this event. Proof of identification will be required and ver
 ified for the purchase or consumption of alcohol.
LOCATION:The Meritage Resort & Spa 875 Bordeaux Way Napa
URL:https://www.marinmommies.com/calendar/napa-easter-brunch-egg-hunt-meri
 tage
