DESCRIPTION:Scottish Country Dancing\nScottish Country Dancing is one of the predecessors of American Square Dancing. Everyone welcome! No partner is required. Comfortable shoes and a love of dance is all you need. Enjoy live music!\n\nClasses are held every Monday with basics from 7:00-8:15\, and more experienced dancers at 8:30-9:30.\n\nFirst time free\, then $10 for first or second session\, or $12 for whole evening.
