SUMMARY:Why Aldous Huxley Took His Title "Brave New World" From Shakespeare
DESCRIPTION:"Why Aldous Huxley Took His Title Brave New World - And Much 
 Else - From William Shakespeare" - By Ed Castellini  Free Admission.  For
  more information about SRJC's Work of Literary Merit\, visit their websi
