SUMMARY:The Kitchen Sync with Marty O'Reilly | Priest Ranch\, Yountville
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260409T183000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260409T210000
UID:260317-aUlrGcWtEOOKY2_cqbscQ
DESCRIPTION:The Kitchen Sync: Sips + Songs + Prix Fixe at Priest Ranch is 
 an elevated dinner and music showcase hosted at the winery’s downtown Yo
 untville Tasting Room\, located in the heart of the Napa Valley. Each even
 t features Priest Ranch’s estate-grown wines\, a seasonal prix fixe dinn
 er menu crafted by Executive Chef Dan Solomon\, and live performances by r
 ecording artists in partnership with A&R Worldwide. Guests can expect the 
 unexpected at this intimate and eclectic series that syncs all the senses 
 through wine\, food\, and the arts.\n\nAbout Marty O’Reilly:\n\nFresh of
 f his stunning performances on The Voice\, Marty O’Reilly is bringing hi
 s music home to The Kitchen Sync at Priest Ranch on Thursday\, April 9 in 
 Yountville. Marty plans a solo and unfiltered performance to close out the
  inaugural season of The Kitchen Sync. The evening also features Chef Dan 
 Solomon’s prix fixe dinner and wines crafted by winemaker Cody Hurd.
LOCATION:Priest Ranch Napa Valley
URL:https://priestranchwines.com/visit/#events
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
