DESCRIPTION:Are you ready to make music\, meet new friends\, and be part o
 f something special? The Sing Napa Valley community choir is welcoming sin
 gers of all experience levels—from first timers to seasoned vocalists! I
 f you love to sing we want YOU! ✨ All voices are welcome! We are espec
 ially looking for tenor and bass singers.\n\n**January 8th is the First Re
 hearsal o**f the Spring/Summer session. Arrive by 6:45pm to register - Re
 hearsals are every Thursday through June 8th. Have questions or want perfo
 rmance dates? Just send us an email! info@singnapavalley.org RSVP your int
