X-SOURCE:Uptowntheatrenapa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260409T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260409T200000
DTSTAMP:20260317T222428
CREATED:20250903T155958Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20250903T164019Z
UID:25141-1775764800-1775764800@www.uptowntheatrenapa.com
SUMMARY:JaM Cellars Presents Black Violin - Full Circle Tour
DESCRIPTION:April 9\, 2026\nPURCHASE TICKETS HERE  \nDoors 7pm/ Show 8pm\nAges: 12+ \n$1 charity lift on each ticket\, proceeds to go to the Black Violin Foundation \nStep into Black Violin’s Full Circle Tour\, where GRAMMY-nominated duo Wil Baptiste and Kev Marcus redefine the possibilities of music by merging classical depth with hip-hop’s pulse. This tour captures the essence of returning to where it all began—transformed and reimagined. Each powerful performance invites audiences to reflect on their own journeys\, discovering that even as we evolve\, we’re often drawn back to our roots with renewed purpose. \nFrom high school orchestra classmates to groundbreaking artists\, Black Violin’s path reflects resilience\, creativity\, and the courage to challenge expectations. With their Black Violin Foundation reaching over 100\,000 students each year\, they’re building a legacy that transcends the stage\, inspiring a new generation to dream boldly. Join them for an unforgettable night that celebrates growth\, music\, and the beauty of coming full circle. \nFollow Black Violin: \nInstagram – https://www.instagram.com/blackviolin/ \nFacebook – https://www.facebook.com/BlackViolinMusic/ \nTik Tok – https://www.tiktok.com/@blackviolinmusic \nSpotify – https://open.spotify.com/artist/4zeHJ3kiJyjYXlIOcG4MA7?si=fFz584TKS3mBl2mWLXktBQ \nWebsite – http://blackviolin.net
URL:https://www.uptowntheatrenapa.com/event/jam-cellars-presents-black-violin-full-circle-tour/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.uptowntheatrenapa.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Black-Violin_1200x800.jpg
END:VEVENT
