BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://sonomagymnasticsacademy.com/home/adult-gymnastics-night/", "Press Democrat": "https://sonomagymnasticsacademy.com/home/adult-gymnastics-night/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://sonomagymnasticsacademy.com/home/adult-gymnastics-night/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Adult Gymnastics Class
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260410T170000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260410T183000
UID:26021438HA0_-VRUCz3k2HSpiAGw
DESCRIPTION:We’re offering Adult Gymnastics Classes for the 18\\+ crowd!
 \n\nAdult Gymnastics classes occur every Tuesday 5:00 PM to 6:30 PM & Fri
 day from 6:30 PM to 8:00 PM.\n\n$20 per person\, OR pay for a whole 8-we
 ek session in advance through our site. You can attend on Tuesday\, Friday
 \, or both!\n\nPlease bring the class fee in cash at the time of arrival. 
 This can be a DROP IN\, so there is no need to sign up online before comin
 g!\n\nIf you’ve ever wanted to try out gymnastics or get back into it in
  adulthood\, now is your chance! During our adult classes\, open to all ge
 nders\, our coaches will move at the pace of each student\, helping them a
 chieve goals they set for themselves. No experience is necessary to be i
 nvolved in this class\, so this is a great opportunity to learn the basics
  and get some exercise\, no matter what age you are! Try out our trampolin
 e\, bars\, beam\, and other gym equipment in a safe and supportive environ
 ment. You can build strength and increase your range of motion while havin
 g fun like you’re a kid again.\n\nAsk our coaches what you can work on b
 etween classes\, and they’ll help personalize your training!\n\nPlease w
 ear something comfortable and keep long hair tied back. Skirts and restric
 tive clothing are not recommended. You must remove your shoes before going
  onto the mat or using equipment. Please let us know if you have any physi
 cal limitations or health conditions that may interfere with doing certain
  motions. We recommend bringing a water bottle.\n\nYou can email us for mo
 re info or join our mailing list at: info@sonomagymnasticsacademy.com
LOCATION:Sonoma Gymnastics Academy
URL:https://sonomagymnasticsacademy.com/home/adult-gymnastics-night/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "http://www.mccunecollection.org"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Threads That Tie Us
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260410T170000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260410T210000
UID:260204y9ctZdsxD0iS6qfrifC2AQ
DESCRIPTION:Explore the blurred lines between everyday objects and artisti
 c expression with a focus on fiber and textile art. In this rebellion agai
 nst the distinction between Craft and Art\, we invite you to experience th
 e surprising and delightful diversity of these works while marveling at th
 e skill\, intuition\, knowledge and wisdom behind their making. The fiber 
 artists include Britt-Marie Alm\, Stephanie Brown\, Risa Iwasaki Culbertso
 n\, Amanda Farrell\, Jennifer Laursen\, Youngmi Angela Pak\, Leigh Ann Par
 ente and Vida Vazquez who each create\, in unique ways\, something new fro
 m raw or recycled materials\, intuitively and humanely imbuing them with b
 eauty and authenticity.
LOCATION:The McCune Collection
URL:http://www.mccunecollection.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.longboardvineyards.com", "Press Democrat": "https://www.longboardvineyards.com"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.longboardvineyards.com"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Longboard Vineyards Wine\, Dine & Dance
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260410T170000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260410T190000
UID:2512221J7yCU9sI0qKqzjrGJr2KA
DESCRIPTION:Friday Night Music\, Wine & Dine at Longboard Vineyards\n\n**F
 eaturing Smoke & Mirrors & SoCo Paella**\n\nJoin us for a lively Friday ni
 ght at Longboard Vineyards in our Barrel Room\, located in downtown Healds
 burg\, featuring live music\, award-winning wine\, and bold\, unforgettabl
 e food. Our Music\, Wine & Dine Night pairs the energetic\, crowd-pleasing
  sounds of Smoke & Mirrors with the rich\, made-to-order flavors of SoCo P
 aella.\n\nSmoke & Mirrors brings an upbeat mix of familiar favorites that 
 sets the tone for a relaxed and social evening surrounded by barrels and w
 arm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboard’s wines by the glass or bottle whil
 e SoCo Paella prepares their signature paella on site\, featuring fresh in
 gredients and deep\, savory flavor.\n\nFriday | 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM Free e
 ntry\n\nPlease note: This is an over-21 event inside the Barrel Room. Unde
 r-21 guests and leashed pets are welcome on the patio only.\n\nCome grab a
  seat early and enjoy a classic Sonoma County night of great music\, great
  wine\, and outstanding food.\n\nWine available for purchase Live music by
  Smoke & Mirrors Food by SoCo Paella Location: Longboard Vineyards Barrel 
 Room Address: 5 Fitch Street\, Healdsburg\, CA 95448
LOCATION:Longboard Vineyards
URL:https://www.longboardvineyards.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian, Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107696179?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=287&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Big Rock Deli
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260410T170000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260410T000000
UID:2603122-Qb6oMNVEmJlS7yvzJmiA
DESCRIPTION:BIO - THE LUCKY LOSERS\n\nWinners of six Independent Blues Awa
 rds\, including Artist of the Year \\(Cathy Lemons\\) and Song of the Year
  \\(“Godless Land”\\)\, The Lucky Losers are San Francisco’s premier
  six-piece blues-soul band. Fronted by fiery Dallas-raised vocalist Cathy 
 Lemons and New Jersey harmonica master/vocalist Phil Berkowitz\, the group
  delivers a throwback mix of blues\, soul\, rock\, gospel\, and Americana 
 with impassioned vocals and electrifying interplay.\n\nPraised as “the f
 inest female blues vocalist in the U.S.” \\(Real Blues\\) and “one of 
 the West Coast’s most distinctive harp players” \\(Living Blues\\)\, L
 emons and Berkowitz bring striking contrast and chemistry to the stage\, b
 acked by a powerhouse ensemble that amplifies their soulful originals and 
 dynamic performances. Cathy Lemons and Phil Berkowitz revive the vanishing
  art of the duet while pushing the American blues tradition forward.\n\nSi
 nce 2015\, The Lucky Losers have toured nationally across 46 states\, rele
 ased five critically acclaimed albums\, and earned 6 national awards\, 25 
 nominations\, and two International Songwriting Competition finalist honor
 s. Their discography includes A Winning Hand \\(2015\\)\, In Any Town \\(2
 016\\)\, Blind Spot \\(2018\\)\, Godless Land \\(2020\\)\, and Standin’ 
 Pat \\(2022\\). Each has charted internationally and received praise from 
 major outlets including Downbeat\, Living Blues\, Elmore\, and Blues Music
  Magazine.\n\nWith a full band sound\, raw authenticity\, and undeniable c
 hemistry\, The Lucky Losers continue to captivate audiences and critics al
 ike—cementing their reputation as one of the most compelling blues acts 
 of their generation.
LOCATION:Big Rock Mini Mart & Deli
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107696179?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
