SUMMARY:Emmet Cohen Quintet
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260410T193000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260410T000000
UID:260224-srIZL0k60m7SchBbXT8Ng
DESCRIPTION:Creator of Live from Emmet’s Place\, the most-viewed online 
 jazz show in the world\, and winner of the American Jazz Pianist Competiti
 on\, Emmet Cohen has gained a reputation for connecting with audiences thr
 ough his artistry and commitment to intergenerational exchange. With the E
 mmet Cohen Trio plus special guests Tivon Pennicott and Jeremy Pelt\, he c
 elebrates the centennial of perhaps the two greatest names in jazz history
 : Miles Davis and John Coltrane. Featuring Jeremy Pelt on trumpet—named 
 a Rising Star by Downbeat Magazine—and Tivon Pennicott on tenor sax—wh
 ose “earthbound yet galactic” style earned him the label “sonic heal
 er” \\(All About Jazz\\)\, the ensemble gives their slant on the legacy 
 of the two jazz greats in a concert sure to be warmly familiar and also so
 mething entirely new.
LOCATION:Sonoma State University
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107248194?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"North Bay Bohemian": "https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/indie-after-dark/16448446/2026-04-10T19"}
X-SOURCE-ID:bohemian
SUMMARY:Indie After Dark
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260410T193000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260410T230000
UID:260106TXI_nWb07UO8KsyESTDDhQ
DESCRIPTION:Indie After Dark – Vallejo’s Night for Original Music\n\nS
 eptember 12 performers:\n\n🔥 Agness Twin\n\nSan Francisco’s hypnotic 
 post-punk / indie project led by Elisa Ovrahim. Gorgeous layered vocals\, 
 ringing guitars\, cinematic folk shadows\, and minimalist ethereal pop. Th
 eir new album Turn To Gold \\(2024\\) was mastered by John Golden \\(Sound
 garden\, Melvins\\) and has already carved its place on indie radio. Fresh
  from the Love & Rockets tour\, Agness Twin’s live set will swallow you 
 whole.\n\n🔥 Pro-Pain!\n\nBay Area 4-piece that’s “HAVING A BLAST.
 ” High-voltage energy\, pure grit\, and a sound built to light up the ro
 om. With their recent Bombs Away video\, they’re proof that Vallejo’s 
 underground scene is very much alive and screaming.\n\nEvery Second Friday
 \, Indie After Dark brings the spotlight to independent music at the intim
 ate and vibey 4th Corner Speakeasy in downtown Vallejo. Just steps from th
 e heart of the Vallejo Art Walk\, this monthly series invites you to disco
 ver bold new sounds in a setting made for connection—where the lights ar
 e low\, the cocktails are strong\, and the music runs deep.\n\nCome early 
 for the art\, stay late for the music. It’s a night where Vallejo’s cr
 eative soul shines.
LOCATION:4th Corner Speakeasy
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/indie-after-dark/164484
 46/2026-04-10T19
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
