DESCRIPTION:Waves of Sound\, Moments of Peace. ~ A monthly ritual for your
  Soul.\n\nBring a yoga mat or blanket\, plus pillows and anything you need
  to be cozy\, then simply lie back as waves of sound from crystal bowls\, 
 chimes\, and gongs flow through you. No effort or experience needed.\n\nIt
 ’s like being immersed in a living ocean of sound where every ripple car
 ries you deep into rest\, relaxation\, and a quiet sense of peace.
