UID:260308Lqw6y-zF5U6vtGFntpXm1w
DESCRIPTION:in celebration of **National Poetry Month\,** presents **We
 st County Spring**\, featuring five well-known and beloved West County poe
 t friends. William Greenwood\, Shawna Swetech\, Raphael Block\, Tamsin Smi
 th\, and Larry Robinson will read from their recent collections. with musi
 cal accompaniment by David Field.
