SUMMARY:Callie Watts
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260416T200000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260416T000000
UID:260224l5AR29qmoEi7NRyGyZrihg
DESCRIPTION:Callie Watts is a singer/songwriter from Northern California w
 ho was raised on classical music\, The Beatles and The Beach Boys before d
 iscovering Joni Mitchell\, Elton John\, Stevie Wonder\, Paul Simon\, Billy
  Joel\, Carole King\, and all the great writers of the ’60s and 70’s w
 ho have influenced her sound and writing style. After graduating high scho
 ol\, Callie began playing and performing solo\, as well as in local and ba
 y area bands of different genres. She’s played blues with Eric Lindell a
 nd the Reds\, funky soul with Phatty\, and jazz/swing with Savoy Swingers 
 along with many other various projects. Callie has taken turns throughout 
 her career as a keyboardist\, guitarist\, writer\, and lead/backing vocali
 st\, and she’s currently a member of the dynamic Sonoma County funk rock
  band Burrows and Dilbeck\, having joined in 2010 as part of the former ba
 nd Frobeck. Over time\, she’s had the honor of opening for acts such as 
 Bootsy Collins\, Elvin Bishop\, Huey Lewis and The News\, War\, Ozomatli\,
  Bill Champlin\, Booker T\, and the B52s. Callie continues to perform freq
 uently as an acoustic solo artist\, focusing on developing a core audience
  and a buzz for her original material. Come hang out and listen at venues 
 such as Aroma Roasters\, Rincon Valley Tap Room and Bottle Shop\, and Hopm
 onk Tavern.
LOCATION:City Winery
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107667090?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Press Democrat": "https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1037984758?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=287&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event"}
X-SOURCE-ID:pressdemocrat
SUMMARY:Yaima
DTSTART;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260416T203000
DTEND;TZID=PDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260416T000000
UID:260224FJr-JEwS7UWyVjG4k9E6rg
DESCRIPTION:YAIMA is a Cascadian Elemental & Alchemical Electronic Music D
 uo based in Seattle\, WA. \n\n \n\nCreating an intensely captivating and f
 inely tuned container for their audiences - YAIMA \\(Mas Higasa and Pepper
  Proud\\)\, allow the listener the opportunity to Journey through Sonic So
 undscapes\, traversing sensually stimulating and heart-centered compositio
 ns\, deeply inspiring each listener to return to their truth. Their music 
 is reminiscent of well-known music groups such as Purity Ring\, Massive At
 tack\, Bjork\, Portishead\, Wildlight\, Emancipator\, and Lulacruza.\n\n \
 n\nYAIMA’s music is interwoven with intention and acknowledgment for the
  elementals. As the earth transmutes through fire\, the winds move the wat
 er\, the water falls and replenishes the world - the cycles of gratitude a
 nd reciprocity weave these harmonies and deeply pulsing rhythms into a uni
 que and balanced sensational journey. \n\n \n\nThe name YAIMA emerges from
  two sources\, one from the Mapudungun language meaning "that which water 
 runs through\,” and the other from the gorgeous Island District of Okina
 wa\, Japan. YAIMA's music has been touching people all over the earth\, fr
 om the US\, Canada\, UK\, France\, Spain\, Germany\, Poland\, Italy\, Hung
 ary\, Australia\, New Zealand\, Israel\, Malaysia\, South & Central Americ
 a\, Guatemala\, South East Asia\, and Russia. \n\n \n\nQuotes from our com
 munity:\n\n​\n\n "breathtaking music"….\n\n "music that is our perfect
  prescription medicine”…."heal the soil of our existence and making a 
 difference"...\n\n"music which seems to have a soul of it's own".. "It's v
 ery rare to come across something like that these days"...\n\n"AS FAR AS T
 HE REACHES OF COSMIC LIGHT"... "Your music meets the deep of this wombwarm
 ed firelight as the Northern Mothers say yes to it all. Thank you”…."m
 usic is pure magic...healing to myself and many others close to me”…."
 música tant sentida i lluminosa. Gaudiré i faré gaudir de bons viatges 
 amb OvO….."crying from the beauty of it...stunning music" - "full of poe
 try & love"…"it's certainly worth it"… "the band were all so tight\, a
 nd the visuals were entrancing"…"so much healing to this heart of mine
 ”…."an amazing show!"…"float to that melting point of bliss where he
 artbreak and love are the same thing and there are no boundaries between m
 y skin and the universe”…."medicine songs"…"the much-anticipated OvO
  album!!"…"beautiful music that was been present for me already in so ma
 ny quiet\, celebratory\, precious moments in my life"…..”the music is 
 like a charm :\\)…."This music heals me!"…"vibrational blessings and b
 eautiful artistry".."Social and Evolutionary Culture here and now”…."a
 ngels of technology"….
LOCATION:Mystic Theatre & Music Hall
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1037984758?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=2
 87&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
