DTSTAMP:20260318T052422Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260419T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260419T150000
SUMMARY:Spring Fling Wine Tasting at Stuhlmuller Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nSpring has sprung here in wine country!\n\nI have the pleasure of setting up a fantastic wine tasting at Stuhlmuller Vineyards in Geyserville.\n\nIf you haven't been to Stuhlmuller Vineyards\, you are in for a treat. They are a spacious and unique winery open to the public\, with a tasting room and vineyards in Alexander Valley. They specialize in Pinot Noir\, Cabernet Sauvignon\, Zinfandel\, and Chardonnay. You are welcome to purchase wine outside of the tasting provided.\n\nThere is a maximum of 15 spots available\, and this is a Co-ed event\, so both men and women are welcome.\n\nThe cost of the event is $26\, which includes the wine tasting\, plus our club slush fund fee of $1. They likely will waive the tasting fee with the purchase of wine bottles\, or by becoming members of their wine club.\n\nGuests are welcome. I suggest you wear layers as we will be outside\, and sometimes the weather is windy or cold. Please allow extra time to get there\, the vineyard is about 5 miles from the Highway 101 exit at Lytton. We will confirm headcount about a week before.\n\nCheers to this fun relaxing event!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events/313452848/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260220T223726Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260220T223726Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/e/6/5/600_533140549.jpeg
END:VEVENT
