X-SOURCE-ID:rileystreet_art
X-SOURCE:Riley Street Art Supply
UID:TKF/640bd014795edf4fa3769b14/470/29613420/0/0
DTSTART:20260421T210000Z
DTEND:20260421T233000Z
URL:https://tockify.com/rileystreet.art.com/detail/470/1776805200000
SUMMARY: Watercolor Fundamentals Part 1
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Anne Millett\n\nThis is a 6-class series\, meetin
 g 6 Tuesdays March 24\, 31\, April 7\, 14\, 21\, 28\n2:00-4:30PM\nLocatio
 n: Santa Rosa Store\n$270.00\n\nThere will be a materials fee of $15 plus
  tax for the series.\n\n*optional 7th and 8th classes priced separately\,
  May 5 and 12\n\n\nWatercolor Fundamentals - Part 1\n\nThis class focuses
  on the simple delight of mixing color with water\, brushing it on paper\
 , and watching what happens as it moves and dries. You will learn easy wa
 ys to create paintings that are all about color and the sometimes unpredi
 ctable nature of water.\n\nNo drawing skills are needed.\n\nIn this class
  we will explore the basic principles of watercolor painting. Learn or re
 fresh your understanding of brush handling\, brush care and setting up\, 
 the benefits of “good paper”\, watercolor lights and darks\, flat and gra
 ded washes\, wet-on-wet techniques such as charging\, wet-on-dry techniqu
 es such as glazing\, color wheel\, color theory\, color mixing\, and more
 . Simple applications of these techniques invite you to experiment and pl
 ay.\n\nThis class is designed for adults 18+ (exceptions made for very mo
 tivated teens\, please email to discuss)\n\nclass sizes are limited to 8 
 people\, please register early\n\n$270 for 6 classes\, 2.5 hours each cla
 ss\n\nThere will be a materials fee of $15 plus tax for the series.\n\n*o
 ptional 7th and 8th classes priced separately\nPayable via check\, cash\,
  or Zelle.\n\n*Brushes\, palettes\, set-ups\, and paint will be provided.
 *\n\n\nTo see Anne's work and to learn more about this class\, please vis
 it her website at: www.miraaster.com http://www.miraaster.com/\n\n\nTo re
 gister for this workshop\, please contact Anne by email at: mailto:amille
 tt@gmail.com classes@miraaster.com mailto:classes@miraaster.com
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa,Watercolor
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/640bcf85795edf
 4fa3769ae5/652aed378bbc014a065e4371/scaled_1024.jpg
