X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Santa Rosa Junior College": "https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/15798-climate-action-night"}
X-SOURCE-ID:srjc
X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260423T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260423T190000
LOCATION:Bertolini Student Center - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:Climate Action Night
DESCRIPTION:Student groups from Sonoma County high schools\, Santa Rosa J
 unior College and Sonoma State will present tri-fold posters\, "science f
 air style" about California State Assembly/Senate bills and local county 
 and city campaigns. Come learn about current legislation and local campai
 gns related to climate change\, climate justice and sustainability\, and 
 take action to enact climate solutions.&#160\;  For more information\, vi
 sit the Climate Action Night website! (https://climateactionnight.com)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Student groups from Sonoma County high 
 schools\, Santa Rosa Junior College and Sonoma State will present tri-fol
 d posters\, "science fair style" about California State Assembly/Senate b
 ills and local county and city campaigns. Come learn about current legisl
 ation and local campaigns related to climate change\, climate justice and
  sustainability\, and take action to enact climate solutions.&#160\;</p><
 p>  For more information\, visit the <a href="https://climateactionnight.
 com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Climate Action Night website!</a></p>
UID:20260424T000000Z-15798@calendar.santarosa.edu
DTSTAMP:20260303T143359Z
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/15798-climate-action-night
