BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Luther Burbank Center": "https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/gary-owen-26/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:luther_burbank_center
X-SOURCE:Luther Burbank Center
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260424T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260424T200000
DTSTAMP:20260317T222418
CREATED:20251117T140006Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251113T212959Z
UID:84829-1777060800-1777060800@lutherburbankcenter.org
SUMMARY:ICON Concerts Presents Gary Owen: No Hard Feelings Tour
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nICON Concerts Presents\nGary Owen: No Hard Feelings Tour\n\nFriday\, April 24\, 2026\n\n8:00 pm\n\n\nBUY TICKETS \nGary Owen has been entertaining audiences for more than two decades with his sharp observational humor and fearless storytelling. Known for his unapologetic\, rule-defying style\, his material draws from his personal life\, time in the military\, and the everyday absurdities that connect people across backgrounds. With a fanbase that has grown by the millions in recent months and continues to surge across social media\, Owen’s reach has cemented his place as one of the most in-demand touring comedians today. \nBeyond stand-up\, Owen has appeared in a wide range of feature films and television. He continues to write\, produce\, and perform his own groundbreaking comedy specials. In addition to his on-stage and on-screen work\, Owen hosts his own podcast\, #GetSome with Gary Owen. \nAges 12+ Recommended \n\n\nVIP 1: Gary Owen VIP Meet & Greet Package \n\nPremium Seat Ticket\nMeet & Greet with Gary Owen\nPhoto with Gary Owen\nCommemorative VIP Laminate\nExclusive Autographed Merchandise Item\n\nVIP 2: Gary Owen VIP Merchandise Package \n\nPremium Seat Ticket\nExclusive Autographed Merchandise Item\n*No artist participation\n\n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/gary-owen-26/
CATEGORIES:2025 - 2026 Season,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GaryOwen_SquareImage_1080x1080.jpg
END:VEVENT
