X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Luther Burbank Center": "https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/symphonic-genesis-and-phil-collins/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:luther_burbank_center
X-SOURCE:Luther Burbank Center
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260426T150000
DTSTAMP:20260317T222418
CREATED:20250318T130006Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260312T212801Z
UID:78834-1777215600-1777215600@lutherburbankcenter.org
SUMMARY:Symphony Pops: Symphonic Genesis–Tribute to Phil Collins 🔑
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nSymphony Pops\nSymphonic Genesis–Tribute to Phil Collins\nStuart Chafetz\, Guest Conductor\nAaron Finley and Brook Wood\, Vocalists\nBrian Kushmaul\, Drummer\n\n\nSunday\, April 26\, 2026\n\n3:00 pm\n2:00 pm Pre-Show Discussion\n\n\nBUY INDIVIDUAL TICKETS\n🔑 Featuring a pre‑show Club for membership levels $500+. Click here for info.\n \n \n\nPhil Collins’ one-of-a-kind drum work and songwriting have left an enduring mark on music. Collins and his Genesis bandmates\, Tony Banks and Mike Rutherford\, penned unforgettable hits featured in this symphonic tribute. Accompanied by vocalists Aaron Finley and Brook Wood\, along with drummer Brian Kushmaul\, Guest Conductor Stuart Chafetz will lead some of the best of the best\, including “Follow You Follow Me\,” “Abacab\,” “I Missed Again\,” “Turn It On Again\,” “Sussudio\,” “One More Night\,” “Take Me Home\,” “Two Hearts\,” and the iconic “In the Air Tonight.” \n\nGenerous support provided by Nancy & Michael Hall\, Betty & George Ferris \n\n\n \n\nSymphony Pops Series\nSee the full series here: Symphony Pops Series \n\nSeason ticket packages are available ONLINE now\, or by downloading the form and sending the completed form to us by mail or email. See details on the form. If you have any questions\, call the Patron & Member Services Office at 707.546.3600. Order today to get the best seats! \n\nRenew online\nDownload New Subscription Form\n\n\n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/symphonic-genesis-and-phil-collins/
CATEGORIES:2025 - 2026 Season,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Pops-PhillCollins_SquareImage_1000x1000.png
END:VEVENT
