SUMMARY: Fresh Pressed Flower Card Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Jan Lochner\nSunday\, April 26th\n1:00PM-4:00PM\n
 Santa Rosa Location\n$35.00\n\nThis is a hands on make and take class whe
 re you will make at least five items including a bookmark\, a greeting ca
 rd\, a fridge magnet and an ornament. The class will use two different te
 chniques and Jan will explain how to press flowers and which flowers hold
  their color best. It is a creative experience!\n\n\nTo register for this
  workshop\, please contact Jan at: freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com mail
 to:freshpressedflowercards@yahoo.com\n\nCreating note cards from pressed 
 flowers has been Jan’s hobby for 25 years\, though she has no formal art 
 training. She utilizes color\,\nshape and texture on fine quality paper\,
  each card uniquely handmade. Jan’s home in Sebastopol is her studio: the
  dining room table is her workshop\, the kitchen cupboards storing boxes 
 and trays of flowers. She buy card stock by the thousand and pick blooms 
 from her garden and other public places. Her family is used to me saying\
 , “could we stop for just a few minutes so I can gather some… ”\n\nIt is 
 a wonderful way of life.\n\n*A note to all students: Please park on in th
 e East facing parking lot while attending classes. We greatly appreciate 
 it. Thank you.
CATEGORIES:Santa-Rosa
