BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Luther Burbank Center": "https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/fam-ada-twist25/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:luther_burbank_center
X-SOURCE:Luther Burbank Center
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T153000
DTSTAMP:20260317T222418
CREATED:20250514T130006Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20250826T211153Z
UID:80157-1777822200-1777822200@lutherburbankcenter.org
SUMMARY:Clover Sonoma Family Fun Series: Ada Twist\, Scientist & Friends by TheaterWorksUSA
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nClover Sonoma Family Fun Series\nAda Twist\, Scientist & Friends\nby TheaterWorksUSA\n\n\nSunday\, May 3\, 2026\n\n3:30 pm\n\n\nBUY INDIVIDUAL TICKETS \nWhen Ms. Greer’s classroom field trip goes awry\, three out-of-the-box thinkers must pull their STEM skills together to save the day! Meet Rosie Revere and her engineering dreams\, Iggy Peck\, with her relentless passion for architecture\, and Ada Twist\, whose science curiosity leads her to some adventurous problem solving. In this live musical performance\, our heroes face the ultimate test of their problem-solving skills—a test that can only be conquered through teamwork. Don’t miss this fun musical based on the Andrea Beaty books\, Rosie Revere\, Engineer; Iggy Peck\, Architect\, and Ada Twist\, Scientist\, which spotlight the STEM curriculum (focusing on science\, technology\, engineering and math). \nRecommended for ages 5-9\, however\, you know your child best. \nRun Time: 60 minutes \nLap passes available day of the show\, in-person at the ticket office for ages 2 and under. \n\nLBC performance may not include pieces from above video. \n \nFamily Fun in the Lobby\nStarting one hour before each performance\, please join us in the lobby for fun art projects uniquely developed for each show. It’s a fun\, free way for adults and children alike to get creative\, while enhancing your enjoyment of the show. We also have pizza\, beverages\, and snacks available\, all priced with a family’s budget in mind!   \n\n\nVIPs Meet the Cast\nSubscription holders be sure to stick around after the show to meet the cast and get autographs! (Except The Peking Acrobats®.) \n\n Family Fun Series – Save 20% and see all 5 shows!\nSee the full series here: Clover Sonoma Family Fun Series \n\n\n\nTimeline\n\nNew Subscriptions go on sale for Members beginning June 24; General Public\, June 27.\nIndividual Tickets go on sale for Members beginning August 19; General Public\, August 22.\n\nTwo ways to buy! Season ticket packages are available online or by downloading the form (linked below) and sending the completed form to us by mail or email. If you have any questions\, call the Patron & Member Services Office at 707.546.3600. \n\nPurchase New Subscription ONLINE\nDownload New Subscription Form \n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/fam-ada-twist25/
CATEGORIES:2025 - 2026 Season,Family
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Ada-Scientist-Square-Image-FFS.png
END:VEVENT
