DTSTAMP:20260317T222418
CREATED:20250721T130006Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260312T212540Z
UID:82751-1778270400-1778270400@lutherburbankcenter.org
SUMMARY:An Evening with David Sedaris 🔑
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nDavid Sedaris\n\nFriday\, May 8\, 2026\n\n8:00 pm\n\n\nBUY TICKETS\n\n🔑 Featuring a pre‑show Club for membership levels $500+. Click here for info.\n \nDavid Sedaris is one of America’s pre-eminent humor writers. He is a master of satire and one of today’s most observant writers. \nBeloved for his personal essays and short stories\, David Sedaris is the author of the New York Times bestsellers Barrel Fever\, Holidays on Ice\, Naked\, Me Talk Pretty One Day\, Dress Your Family in Corduroy and Denim\, When You Are Engulfed in Flames\, Let’s Explore Diabetes with Owls\, and Calypso. His book\, The Best of Me\, collects 42 previously published stories and essays. Sedaris also wrote Squirrel Seeks Chipmunk: A Modest Bestiary\, a collection of fables with illustrations by Ian Falconer. He is the editor of Children Playing Before a Statue of Hercules: An Anthology of Outstanding Stories. His pieces regularly appear in The New Yorker and have twice been included in “The Best American Essays.” \n\n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/david-sedaris26/
CATEGORIES:2025 - 2026 Season,Speakers
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/David-Sedaris-2026-Squaare.jpg
END:VEVENT
