UID:83666-1778356800-1778356800@lutherburbankcenter.org
SUMMARY:Bobby Rush & North Mississippi Allstars 🔑
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nBobby Rush & North Mississippi Allstars\n\nSaturday\, May 9\, 2026\n\n8:00 pm\n\n\nBUY TICKETS\n\n🔑 Featuring a pre‑show Club for membership levels $500+. Click here for info.\n \nModern Mississippi Hill Country band North Mississippi Allstars and blues legend Bobby Rush are co-headlining this unique event\, with each artist performing separately before joining together to honor their Mississippi blues roots. \nNorth Mississippi Allstars was started by brothers Luther and Cody Dickinson in 1996 as a loose collective of musicians from their North Mississippi home. They were inspired by their father Jim Dickinson as well as neighbors and musical elders of their community\, including RL Burnside\, Junior Kimbrough\, Otha Turner\, and Fred McDowell. They have multiple Grammy® nominations for their acclaimed experimental albums\, and the latest album\, Still Shakin’\, is out now. \nThe 91-year-old Bobby Rush is a three-time Grammy Award® winner for “Best Traditional Blues Album” for Porcupine Meat\, Rawer than Raw\, and 2024’s All My Love for You. He is also a 16-time Blues Music Awards winner (with 56 career nominations) and has been inducted into the Blues Hall of Fame\, Mississippi Musicians Hall of Fame and Rhythm & Blues Hall of Fame. \n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/north-mississippi-allstars-bobby-rush26/
CATEGORIES:2025 - 2026 Season,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Bobby-Rush-and-NMA-_SquareImage_1000x1000.png
END:VEVENT
