X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Luther Burbank Center": "https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/napoleon-dynamite-live25/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:luther_burbank_center
X-SOURCE:Luther Burbank Center
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260515T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260515T193000
DTSTAMP:20260317T222418
CREATED:20250519T130006Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20250620T160003Z
UID:80350-1778873400-1778873400@lutherburbankcenter.org
SUMMARY:Napoleon Dynamite Live - A Conversation with Jon Heder\, Efren Ramirez\, and Jon Gries
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nNapoleon Dynamite Live\nA Conversation with Jon Heder\, Efren Ramirez\, and Jon Gries\n\n\nFriday\, May 15\, 2026\n\n7:30 pm\n\n\nBUY TICKETS \nSince the release of the beloved indie classic\, Napoleon Dynamite\, 20 years ago\, much has changed\, but the characters\, as enduring as they are endearing\, stay in our hearts. This unique evening includes a full screening of Napoleon Dynamite\, followed by a lively discussion with cast members\, Jon Heder (Napoleon Dynamite)\, Jon Gries (Uncle Rico)\, and Efren Ramirez (Pedro). Perfect for the whole family\, this live show is a wild and hysterical blend of Q&A\, comedy improv\, game show\, and party\, with plenty of audience participation. \n\n\nVIP Meet and Greet Add-On Option: \nElevate your event experience with this exclusive chance to meet Jon Heder (Napoleon)\, Efren Ramirez (Pedro)\, and Jon Gries (Uncle Rico)\, including a photo opportunity. With limited tickets available\, be sure to reserve yours soon! \n\n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/napoleon-dynamite-live25/
CATEGORIES:2025 - 2026 Season,Speakers
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/12/Napolean-Dynamite-Live-25-Square-Image-1.png
END:VEVENT
