UID:event_313060290@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260318T052422Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T150000
SUMMARY:A Wine & Garden Party Fit for Mrs. Roper
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nQuirky\, fun\, and always dressed with comfort and flair\, Mrs. Roper was a vibe.\n\n**Event Details**\nWine Tasting & small\nBites $25 per person. Fee paid directly to winery on day of event.\n\n**Theme & Dress Code ideas:**\n•Flowy colorful muumuus\n•Big sunglasses\n•Costume jewelry\n•Wigs or turbans\nThere may be games & prizes 😎\n\nAmazon is a great site for all your Mrs. Roper needs!\n\nAbout Smith-Story winery:\nSmith Story Wine Cellars\, based in Sonoma County\, is the labor of love for Eric and Alison\, who bring their combined 40+ years in the wine industry to the venture. Born out of their shared passion for wines during their tenure at K&L Wine Merchants\, the couple founded the winery after eloping in Hawaii in 2013. Eric’s expertise lies in wine buying and retail management\, specifically in European wines\, while Ali excels in hospitality\, marketing\, and sales\, providing a complete wine-supply-chain approach. Respect for the land and love for winemaking guide their philosophy\, as they utilize old world techniques in creating balanced and expressive wines from family-owned vineyards. Acting with kindness for the grower and commitment to quality\, Smith Story Wine Cellars embodies the vision of its founders to create wines that encapsulate their journey and passion.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events/313060290/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260126T062247Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260126T062247Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/4/1/3/600_532445139.jpeg
END:VEVENT
