UID:86372-1779478200-1779478200@lutherburbankcenter.org
SUMMARY:Lucy Darling - Simply Darling
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nLucy Darling – Simply Darling\n\nFriday\, May 22\, 2026\n\n7:30 pm\n\n\nBUY TICKETS \nAward-winning performer Carisa Hendrix stars as the charming\, 1940s-style socialite and cocktail enthusiast Lucy Darling as she continues her vivacious vagabond voyages with Simply Darling\, a touring variety show featuring her razor-sharp wit\, unquestionable advice\, and skillful magic. Now that Lucy is bringing her signature charm and mischief from screen to stage with Simply Darling\, it’s the perfect chance to take a break from reality and indulge in the mischief\, sarcasm\, and wonder that we all deserve. \n\n\nPre-Show Talkback \nEnjoy a candid conversation with Carisa Hendrix (the performer behind Lucy Darling) two hours before showtime. Hear never-before-told stories\, ask your own questions\, and get a behind-the-scenes look at the artistry behind the performance. Limited spots available. \nPost-Show Meet & Greet (limited availability) \nPost-Show Meet & Greet includes meeting Lucy Darling after the show and taking a professional photograph with the icon herself. Guests will also receive a limited-edition lanyard and an exclusive merchandise gift to remember the night. The perfect cherry on top of an unforgettable evening. \nAge restriction for 13 years+ \n\n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/lucy-darling/
CATEGORIES:2025 - 2026 Season,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LucyDarling26_SquareImageNOTEXT_1080x1080.jpg
END:VEVENT
