SUMMARY:Press Democrat Presents North Coast Wine & Food Festival
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nPress Democrat Presents\nNorth Coast Wine & Food Festival\n\nSaturday\, June 13\, 2026\n\n12:00 pm VIP Entry\n1:00 pm General Admission\n\n\nBUY TICKETS \n\n\nGet ready for a day of indulgence\, discovery\, and celebration at the North Coast Wine & Food Festival\, the North Bay’s premier showcase of exceptional wines and culinary talent. The festival brings together gold-medal-winning wines from Sonoma\, Napa\, and Mendocino counties\, alongside inspired bites from some of the region’s most celebrated chefs. Guests are invited to sip\, savor\, and connect—meeting the winemakers behind the pours and tasting dishes that reflect the rich agricultural and cultural diversity of the North Coast. \nFrom elegant caviar to bold barbecue and globally inspired flavors\, the culinary offerings are as diverse as they are delicious\, all complemented by live music and the vibrant energy of wine country. As festival attendee Dennis McCarter of McCarter Cellars shared\, “The great food at the event elevates the great wine\, and the great wine elevates the great food.” Established as a must-attend event for food and wine lovers alike\, the North Coast Wine & Food Festival is more than a tasting—it’s a joyful celebration of craftsmanship\, community\, and the good life. \nMust be 21 or older to attend. \nDesignated driver tickets are available\, along with a limited selection of non-alcoholic beverages. \n\n\n\n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/pd-ncwff26/
CATEGORIES:2025 - 2026 Season,Special Presentation
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/NCWFF26-dig1920x1080.png
END:VEVENT
