UID:86283-1781379000-1781379000@lutherburbankcenter.org
SUMMARY:Roustabout Theater's Professional Ensemble Presents The Homecoming
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nRoustabout Theater’s Professional Ensemble Presents\nThe Homecoming\nSaturday\, June 13\, 7:30pm\nSunday\, June 14\, 2:00pm\nSaturday\, June 20\, 7:30pm\nSunday\, June 21\, 2:00pm\nFriday\, June 26\, 7:30pm\nSaturday\, June 27\, 7:30pm\nSunday\, June 28\, 2:00pm\n\n\n\nBuy Tickets for June 13 at 7:30 pm\nBuy Tickets for June 14 at 2:00 pm\nBuy Tickets for June 20 at 7:30 pm\nBuy Tickets for June 21 at 2:00 pm\nBuy Tickets for June 26 at 7:30 pm\nBuy Tickets for June 27 at 7:30 pm\nBuy Tickets for June 28 at 2:00 pm \nRoustabout Theater’s Intimate Revival of Harold Pinter’s The Homecoming Explores Family\, Power and Desire \nA searing masterpiece of modern theater\, The Homecoming returns to the stage in a riveting new production that features beloved North Bay actors in this provocative drama by Nobel Prize–winning playwright Harold Pinter. \nSet in 1960’s North London\, The Homecoming explores how an unexpected family reunion spirals into a tense and witty psychological battle\, as shifting alliances and unspoken desires transform the household. Through razor-sharp dialogue and unexpected humor\, Pinter draws audiences into a world where every pause speaks volumes. \nCelebrated for its daring themes and uncompromising vision\, The Homecoming won the Tony Award for Best Play and remains one of the defining works of twentieth-century drama. Roustabout’s dynamic Ensemble promises a memorable theatrical event as it questions the roles we perform within our own families. \nPerformances are June 13 – 28 at The Luther Burbank Center for the Arts where Roustabout Theater is Resident Theater Company. \nRoustabout Theater is the longest running Resident Theater at the LBC offering both our Professional Ensemble performances utilizing professional talent from across the Bay Area and our award-winning Apprentice Program\, a leading training program for actors and stage managers ages 11 – 20. \n\n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/roustabout-the-homecoming/
CATEGORIES:2025 - 2026 Season,Theatre
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Homecoming-eblast1.jpg
END:VEVENT
