SUMMARY:Symphony Pops: A Tribute to John Williams\, The Movie Maestro
DESCRIPTION:Back to All Shows\n\n\nSymphony Pops\nA Tribute to John Williams\, The Movie Maestro\nTroy Quinn\, Pops Conductor \n\n\nSunday\, October 18\, 2026\n\n3:00 pm\n2:00 pm pre-show discussion\n\n\nIndividual tickets on sale Aug 18 for LBC Members; Aug 21 for the public. \n \n\nRelive the magic of the movies as the Symphony Pops celebrates the legendary music of composer John Williams. A Tribute to John Williams\, The Movie Maestro brings to life the unforgettable scores that have shaped generations of film lovers\, from the swashbuckling fun of Hook and the heroic sweep of Superman to the wonder of E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial. Journey to galaxies far\, far away with music from Star Wars\, feel the patriotic power of the theme from The Patriot\, and thrill to the iconic sounds of Jurassic Park—all performed live in a concert packed with cinematic excitement. \n\nGenerous support provided by Nancy & Michael Hall and the Heck Foundation. \n\n\n\nSymphony Pops Series\nSee the full series here: Symphony Pops Series \n\nSeason ticket packages are available ONLINE now\, or by downloading the form and sending the completed form to us by mail or email. See details on the form. If you have any questions\, call the Patron & Member Services Office at 707.546.3600. Order today to get the best seats! \n\nRenew online\nDownload New Subscription Form\n\n \n\nTHIRD PARTY RESELLERS\nDon’t get taken by deceptive online resellers who use bots to buy tickets and then mark up their prices. The only safe way to protect your purchase and guarantee the best seats at the lowest cost is to work directly with us: through our website\, by phone\, or at our box office in Santa Rosa. Plus\, we’re not bots. Our friendly team members are easily accessible by phone or at the box office to provide customer support.
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/the-movie-maestro/
CATEGORIES:2026-2027 Season,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/POPSJohnWilliams_SquareImage_1080x1080.jpg
END:VEVENT
