SUMMARY: Expressive Portraits
DESCRIPTION:Instructor: Suzanne Carson\n\nThursdays 11 am - 1 pm\n\nBegin
 ning March 19\n\nFee: $30/Session/Ongoing\n\nDrawing a Portrait is Challe
 nging and Fun!\n\nPortraits have always been my forte. I spent many years
  as a quick sketch portrait artist and later studied classical and impres
 sionistic portraits.\n\nThis class will have projects and demos covering 
 basic head structure and features\, how to get a likeness and capture tho
 se qualities that make a portrait unique. We will also explore different 
 portrait styles in art history.\n\nUsing photo references\, we will begin
  with pencil and charcoal before using color. Students can work on their 
 own projects as well. Beginning to advanced students.\n\nTo enroll please
  call or text Suzanne at 707-888-2083
